('52c60a9b-c563-5fe2-82ee-09f87fb87d41','2ce44b29-72f9-582e-b5cb-26b2e85c3a19',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to give something as an example',null,null,'چیزی را به عنوان مثال بیاورم','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"She instanced the first chapter as proof of his skill in constructing scenes.","translation":"او فصل اول را به عنوان مدرکی بر مهارت او در ساختن صحنه ها مثال زد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001416925.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('29d902e3-861d-5345-9d3a-ccbc28929067','cae06452-d5fd-5df9-a94d-0ab7bf0e4c23',1,null,null,'spoken & written','if you have an interest in something or someone, you want to know or learn more about them','[ singular, uncountable ]',null,'علاقه، کنجکاوی؛ سود (مالی)؛ منفعت','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['have an interest in something Steve has a keen interest in bird-watching.','show interest in something He had shown great interest in her work.','express an interest in something (= say that you are interested in something ) A number of well-known film directors have expressed interest in the script.','take an interest in something (= be interested in something ) Jacky first took an interest in golf when he was about six years old.','have no interest in something Andy had no interest in politics.','lose interest in something (= stop being interested ) Tilda had lost interest in what was being said.','arouse/generate/attract interest (= make people interested ) This extraordinary story has aroused interest in many quarters.','feign interest (= pretend to be interested ) Ted scanned the report, feigning interest.','interest grows Interest in the project has steadily grown.','interest wanes (= becomes less ) When his initial interest waned, the teacher paid more attention to him.','great interest The government has shown great interest in the idea.','enormous/intense interest (= very great ) This tournament has created enormous interest.','considerable/strong/keen interest The results of their work will be of considerable interest.','special/particular interest Natural history was a special interest of his.','a personal interest in something He took a personal interest in the lives of his workers.','renewed interest (= starting again after it had stopped ) There has been a renewed interest in abstract painting in recent years.','a consuming interest (= a very strong feeling of interest ) Roland had a consuming interest in cricket.','a long-term/abiding interest (= an interest you have had for a long time ) She has had a long-term interest in antiques.','a lot of interest There has been a lot of interest in the story.','a great deal of interest (= a lot of interest ) The exhibition has generated a great deal of interest.','a lack of interest The show was cancelled due to a lack of interest on the part of the public.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"My parents encouraged my interest in science.","translation":"والدینم علاقه مرا به علم تشویق کردند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001973262.mp3"},{"sentence":"I’d recommend this book to anyone who has an interest in jazz.","translation":"من این کتاب را به هر کسی که به موسیقی جاز علاقه دارد توصیه می کنم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001973263.mp3"},{"sentence":"Ben has shown an interest in learning French.","translation":"بن به یادگیری زبان فرانسه علاقه نشان داده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001973267.mp3"},{"sentence":"My mother had never expressed any interest in the garden.","translation":"مادرم هرگز به باغ ابراز علاقه نکرده بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001973271.mp3"},{"sentence":"Babies soon begin to take an interest in the world around them.","translation":"نوزادان به زودی به دنیای اطراف خود علاقه نشان می دهند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001973277.mp3"},{"sentence":"John appeared to have no interest in girls.","translation":"به نظر می رسید که جان هیچ علاقه ای به دختران ندارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001973281.mp3"},{"sentence":"I watched the first few episodes, but soon lost interest .","translation":"من چند قسمت اول را تماشا کردم، اما خیلی زود علاقه‌ام را از دست دادم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001973285.mp3"},{"sentence":"The last round of bidding aroused considerable interest .","translation":"آخرین دور مناقصه علاقه قابل توجهی را برانگیخت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001973289.mp3"},{"sentence":"Our survey reveals a disturbing lack of interest in teacher training.","translation":"نظرسنجی ما فقدان نگران کننده علاقه به آموزش معلمان را نشان می دهد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001973295.mp3"},{"sentence":"I read your article with great interest .","translation":"مقاله شما را با علاقه فراوان خواندم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001973299.mp3"}]'::jsonb,10),
('fb2c0b12-0d5a-5f15-801c-1b74ec78b684','cae06452-d5fd-5df9-a94d-0ab7bf0e4c23',2,null,null,'spoken & written','an activity that you enjoy doing or a subject that you enjoy studying','[ countable usually plural ]',null,'فعالیتی که از انجام آن لذت می برید یا موضوعی که از مطالعه آن لذت می برید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['have an interest in something Steve has a keen interest in bird-watching.','show interest in something He had shown great interest in her work.','express an interest in something (= say that you are interested in something ) A number of well-known film directors have expressed interest in the script.','take an interest in something (= be interested in something ) Jacky first took an interest in golf when he was about six years old.','have no interest in something Andy had no interest in politics.','lose interest in something (= stop being interested ) Tilda had lost interest in what was being said.','arouse/generate/attract interest (= make people interested ) This extraordinary story has aroused interest in many quarters.','feign interest (= pretend to be interested ) Ted scanned the report, feigning interest.','interest grows Interest in the project has steadily grown.','interest wanes (= becomes less ) When his initial interest waned, the teacher paid more attention to him.','great interest The government has shown great interest in the idea.','enormous/intense interest (= very great ) This tournament has created enormous interest.','considerable/strong/keen interest The results of their work will be of considerable interest.','special/particular interest Natural history was a special interest of his.','a personal interest in something He took a personal interest in the lives of his workers.','renewed interest (= starting again after it had stopped ) There has been a renewed interest in abstract painting in recent years.','a consuming interest (= a very strong feeling of interest ) Roland had a consuming interest in cricket.','a long-term/abiding interest (= an interest you have had for a long time ) She has had a long-term interest in antiques.','a lot of interest There has been a lot of interest in the story.','a great deal of interest (= a lot of interest ) The exhibition has generated a great deal of interest.','a lack of interest The show was cancelled due to a lack of interest on the part of the public.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"His interests include walking and golf.","translation":"علایق او پیاده روی و گلف است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001721478.mp3"},{"sentence":"As a biologist, my main interest has been human genetics.","translation":"به عنوان یک زیست شناس، علاقه اصلی من ژنتیک انسانی بوده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001721479.mp3"},{"sentence":"Her outside interests (= interests that are not part of her work ) were numerous.","translation":"علایق بیرونی او (= علایقی که جزء کار او نیستند) متعدد بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001721480.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('759d7f9b-9f77-5f62-8300-312a6048a852','cae06452-d5fd-5df9-a94d-0ab7bf0e4c23',3,null,null,'spoken & written','a quality or feature of something that attracts your attention or makes you want to know more about it','[ uncountable ]',null,'کیفیت یا ویژگی چیزی که توجه شما را به خود جلب می کند یا باعث می شود که بیشتر در مورد آن بدانید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['have an interest in something Steve has a keen interest in bird-watching.','show interest in something He had shown great interest in her work.','express an interest in something (= say that you are interested in something ) A number of well-known film directors have expressed interest in the script.','take an interest in something (= be interested in something ) Jacky first took an interest in golf when he was about six years old.','have no interest in something Andy had no interest in politics.','lose interest in something (= stop being interested ) Tilda had lost interest in what was being said.','arouse/generate/attract interest (= make people interested ) This extraordinary story has aroused interest in many quarters.','feign interest (= pretend to be interested ) Ted scanned the report, feigning interest.','interest grows Interest in the project has steadily grown.','interest wanes (= becomes less ) When his initial interest waned, the teacher paid more attention to him.','great interest The government has shown great interest in the idea.','enormous/intense interest (= very great ) This tournament has created enormous interest.','considerable/strong/keen interest The results of their work will be of considerable interest.','special/particular interest Natural history was a special interest of his.','a personal interest in something He took a personal interest in the lives of his workers.','renewed interest (= starting again after it had stopped ) There has been a renewed interest in abstract painting in recent years.','a consuming interest (= a very strong feeling of interest ) Roland had a consumi