('922ce43b-dc1c-5cc6-82be-1333d215b974','b2ff3ffa-ecb2-5599-9a4e-f8b1019b4667',4,null,null,'spoken & written','having so many different parts that it is difficult to understand',null,null,'دارای بخش های مختلف بسیار زیادی است که درک آن دشوار است',array['complicated']::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The plot was so involved that very few people knew what was going on.","translation":"این طرح به قدری درگیر بود که تعداد کمی از مردم می دانستند چه اتفاقی دارد می افتد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001429560.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('dca18838-5ad8-526b-bb70-825b2079ccbf','01afccf7-b298-570b-8d11-ce3926487824',1,'opinion','نظر','spoken & written','an opinion that you form, especially after thinking carefully about something','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'نظر، داوری؛ حکم (دادگاه)؛ سنجش‌گری (ذهن)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['make a judgment It''s too soon to make a judgment about what the outcome will be.','form a judgment (= make a judgment ) I prefer to form my own judgments, rather than relying on other people''s opinions.','pass judgment (on something) (= give your opinion, especially a negative one ) Our aim is to help him, not to pass judgment on what he has done.','reserve judgment (= not decide your opinion before you have all the facts ) Why don''t you reserve judgment until you have finished the book?','base a judgment on something (= make a judgment because of something ) His judgment was based on bad information.','a moral judgment (= based on what you think is right ) People are always making moral judgments about weight loss.','a snap judgment (= made quickly ) In my business, I often have to make snap judgments about people.','against your better judgment (= even though you think your action might be wrong ) I lent him the money, against my better judgment.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"It’s too soon to make a judgment about what the outcome will be.","translation":"برای قضاوت در مورد اینکه نتیجه چه خواهد بود خیلی زود است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001755102.mp3"},{"sentence":"In my judgment, we should accept his offer.","translation":"به نظر من باید پیشنهاد او را بپذیریم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001755106.mp3"},{"sentence":"Our aim is to help him, not to pass judgment on what he has done.","translation":"هدف ما این است که به او کمک کنیم، نه اینکه در مورد کاری که انجام داده است قضاوت کنیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001755107.mp3"},{"sentence":"I’d advise you to reserve judgment (= not decide your opinion before you have all the facts ) .","translation":"من به شما توصیه می کنم که قضاوت خود را حفظ کنید (= قبل از اینکه همه حقایق را داشته باشید، نظر خود را تصمیم نگیرید).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001755108.mp3"},{"sentence":"I lent him the money, against my better judgment.","translation":"برخلاف قضاوت بهترم، پول را به او قرض دادم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001755116.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('c4737acb-f451-53ff-bae1-7452a2a7e3a3','01afccf7-b298-570b-8d11-ce3926487824',2,'ability to decide','توانایی تصمیم گیری','spoken & written','the ability to make sensible decisions about what to do and when to do it','[ uncountable ]','error of judgment','توانایی تصمیم گیری معقول در مورد اینکه چه کاری و چه زمانی باید انجام شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['make a judgment It''s too soon to make a judgment about what the outcome will be.','form a judgment (= make a judgment ) I prefer to form my own judgments, rather than relying on other people''s opinions.','pass judgment (on something) (= give your opinion, especially a negative one ) Our aim is to help him, not to pass judgment on what he has done.','reserve judgment (= not decide your opinion before you have all the facts ) Why don''t you reserve judgment until you have finished the book?','base a judgment on something (= make a judgment because of something ) His judgment was based on bad information.','a moral judgment (= based on what you think is right ) People are always making moral judgments about weight loss.','a snap judgment (= made quickly ) In my business, I often have to make snap judgments about people.','against your better judgment (= even though you think your action might be wrong ) I lent him the money, against my better judgment.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"I’ve known him for years and I trust his judgment.","translation":"من سال ها او را می شناسم و به قضاوت او اعتماد دارم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001755117.mp3"},{"sentence":"The minister showed a lack of political judgment.","translation":"وزیر عدم قضاوت سیاسی را نشان داد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001755120.mp3"},{"sentence":"a decision based on sound judgment (= good judgment )","translation":"تصمیمی مبتنی بر قضاوت صحیح (= قضاوت خوب)","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001755121.mp3"},{"sentence":"Watch carefully and use your judgment .","translation":"با دقت تماشا کنید و از قضاوت خود استفاده کنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001755125.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('b7a7866b-f737-56c9-aadf-f05bef1a9a90','01afccf7-b298-570b-8d11-ce3926487824',3,'law','قانون','spoken & written','an official decision given by a judge or a court of law','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'تصمیم رسمی صادر شده توسط قاضی یا دادگاه حقوقی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['make a judgment It''s too soon to make a judgment about what the outcome will be.','form a judgment (= make a judgment ) I prefer to form my own judgments, rather than relying on other people''s opinions.','pass judgment (on something) (= give your opinion, especially a negative one ) Our aim is to help him, not to pass judgment on what he has done.','reserve judgment (= not decide your opinion before you have all the facts ) Why don''t you reserve judgment until you have finished the book?','base a judgment on something (= make a judgment because of something ) His judgment was based on bad information.','a moral judgment (= based on what you think is right ) People are always making moral judgments about weight loss.','a snap judgment (= made quickly ) In my business, I often have to make snap judgments about people.','against your better judgment (= even though you think your action might be wrong ) I lent him the money, against my better judgment.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The company were fined £6 million, following a recent court judgment .","translation":"این شرکت پس از حکم دادگاه اخیر، ۶ میلیون پوند جریمه شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001431374.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
