('d4e0ccdd-d28e-5af6-aa76-743ca0264069','e9dd7910-baf2-52f4-9c33-04a8a2f79dcd',3,null,null,'spoken & written','someone whose job is to represent their country in another country, but who is lower in rank than an ambassador',null,null,'کسی که وظیفه اش نمایندگی کشورش در کشور دیگری است، اما از نظر رتبه پایین تر از یک سفیر است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('490e4323-aa45-5b5e-a45f-02c4b621ebe9','a749043e-d8e7-53af-8393-4759633f8ae9',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to work as a priest',null,null,'برای کار کشیش','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Rev Wilson spent 20 years ministering in some of New York’s poorest areas.","translation":"کشیش ویلسون 20 سال را در برخی از فقیرترین مناطق نیویورک خدمت کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001554155.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('5416307f-6d57-547c-96a7-66706564df2f','0fd0cc4f-ce9b-5e70-b2c9-e283d6a15a55',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a government department that is responsible for one of the areas of government work, such as education or health','[ countable ]',null,'وزارت‌خانه، وزارت','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"the Ministry of Agriculture","translation":"وزارت کشاورزی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001554160.mp3"},{"sentence":"a Defence Ministry spokesman","translation":"سخنگوی وزارت دفاع","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001554163.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('5c17cc98-39d7-5fbb-b4cf-fe2fde92c6d5','0fd0cc4f-ce9b-5e70-b2c9-e283d6a15a55',2,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'the ministry','وزارت‌خانه، وزارت','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('f70da994-c8da-58e2-8ef8-0ee38e2e8cd2','0fd0cc4f-ce9b-5e70-b2c9-e283d6a15a55',3,null,null,'spoken & written','the work done by a priest or other religious person as a result of their religious beliefs','[ countable usually singular ]',null,'کاری که کشیش یا سایر افراد مذهبی در نتیجه اعتقادات مذهبی آنها انجام می دهد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"the ministry of Jesus","translation":"خدمت عیسی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000199577.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('325478d3-19b8-5fa1-8509-222db28f6617','662b8bcd-2336-5a62-a9bb-d16d653a2338',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a small group of people or things within a much larger group','[ singular ]',null,'اقلیت؛ اقلیت‌ها (قومی)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a small minority She is one of a small minority of women working in engineering.','a tiny minority Only a tiny minority of the population actually commit crimes.','a large minority A large minority of women feel happier when their husbands leave them.','a substantial/sizeable minority (= a large minority ) A sizeable minority of people sleep less than five hours a night without problems.','a significant minority (= a large and fairly important minority ) A significant minority of older people have difficulty in caring for themselves.','be in a minority Male students are in a minority in this class.','represent a minority Old people still only represent a minority of the population.','form a minority ( also constitute a minority formal ) This type of cell forms a minority of the cells in the nervous system.','affect a minority The side effects only affect a minority of people who take the drug.','a minority group It’s ridiculous to refer to women as a minority group.','a minority interest Jazz is a minority interest, but it is still an important part of musical studies.','a minority opinion/view This is a minority view among scientists.','a minority stake (= a number of shares in a company, equalling less than half the total number ) IBM has bought a minority stake in the computer company.','a minority shareholder (= someone who owns less than half the shares in a company ) A minority shareholder with 10% of voting rights refused to accept the plan.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Gaelic is still spoken in Ireland by a minority.","translation":"گالیک هنوز در ایرلند توسط اقلیت صحبت می شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce6exa_00594.mp3"},{"sentence":"Only a minority of people supported these new laws.","translation":"فقط تعداد کمی از مردم از این قوانین جدید حمایت کردند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce6exa_00595.mp3"},{"sentence":"Gay men are a small but significant minority.","translation":"مردان همجنس گرا یک اقلیت کوچک اما قابل توجه هستند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001761247.mp3"},{"sentence":"A small minority refuses to cooperate.","translation":"اقلیت کوچکی از همکاری امتناع می ورزند.","audio_url":null},{"sentence":"A small minority refuse to cooperate.","translation":"اقلیت کوچکی از همکاری امتناع می ورزند.","audio_url":null}]'::jsonb,5),
('47da614a-7e50-5f00-b152-314957dcdcad','662b8bcd-2336-5a62-a9bb-d16d653a2338',2,null,null,'spoken & written','a group of people of a different race , religion etc from most other people in that country','[ countable usually plural ]',null,'گروهی از مردم از نژاد، مذهب و غیره متفاوت از اکثر مردم آن کشور','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a small minority She is one of a small minority of women working in engineering.','a tiny minority Only a tiny minority of the population actually commit crimes.','a large minority A large minority of women feel happier when their husbands leave them.','a substantial/sizeable minority (= a large minority ) A sizeable minority of people sleep less than five hours a night without problems.','a significant minority (= a large and fairly important minority ) A significant minority of older people have difficulty in caring for themselves.','be in a minority Male students are in a minority in this class.','represent a minority Old people still only represent a minority of the population.','form a minority ( also constitute a minority formal ) This type of cell forms a minority of the cells in the nervous system.','affect a minority The side effects only affect a minority of people who take the drug.','a minority group It’s ridiculous to refer to women as a minority group.','a minority interest Jazz is a minority interest, but it is still an important part of musical studies.','a minority opinion/view This is a minority view among scientists.','a minority stake (= a number of shares in a company, equalling less than half the total number ) IBM has bought a minority stake in the computer company.','a minority shareholder (= someone who owns less than half the shares in a company ) A minority shareholder with 10% of voting rights refused to accept the plan.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"People from ethnic minorities often face prejudice.","translation":"افراد اقلیت های قومی اغلب با تعصب روبرو هستند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000199735.mp3"},{"sentence":"the very large Russian minorities in Ukraine and Moldova","translation":"اقلیت های بسیار بزرگ روسی در اوکراین و مولداوی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001554217.mp3"},{"sentence":"children from minority groups","translation":"کودکان از گروه های اقلیت","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001554222.mp3"},{"sentence":"the teaching of minority languages in schools","translation":"آموزش زبان های اقلیت ها در مدارس","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001554218.mp3"},{"sentence":"a school with a high proportion of minority students","translation":"مدرسه ای با نسبت بالایی از دانش آموزان اقلیت","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001761248.mp3"},{"sentence":"Businesses are under pressure to hire minorities and women.","translation":"مشاغل برای استخدام اقلیت ها و زنان تحت فشار هستند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000199740.mp3"}]'::jsonb,6),
('f23897aa-b83a-5ffc-ae20-fdfd21b2d740','662b8bcd-2336-5a62-a9bb-d16d653a2338',3,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'be in the/a minority','اقلیت؛ اقلیت‌ها (قومی)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a small minority She is one of a small minority of women working in engineering.','a tiny minority Only a tiny minority of the population actually commit crimes.','a large minority A large minority of women feel happier when their husbands leave them.','a substantial/sizeable minority (= a large minority ) A sizeable minority of people sleep less than five hours a night without problems.','a significant minority (= a large and fairly important minority ) A significant minority of older people have difficulty in caring for themselves.','be in a minority Male students are in a minority in this class.','represent a minority Old people still only represent a minority of the population.','form a minority ( also constitute a minority formal ) This type of cell forms a minority of the cells in the nervous system.','affect a minority The side effects only affect a minority of people who take the drug.','a minority group It’s ridiculous to refer to women as a minority group.','a minority interest Jazz is a minority interest, but it is still an important part of musical studies.','a minority opinion/view This is a minority view among scientists.','a minority stake (= a number of shares in a company, equalling less than half the total number ) IBM has bought a minority stake in the computer company.','a minority shareholder (= someone who owns less than half the shares in a company ) A minority shareholder with 10% of voting rights refused to accept the plan.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
