('dc8410e4-ddd1-5066-a85d-fb88ce71cd49','382b476e-76c8-5d60-8fb5-27ad6e79e387',1,'untrue/stupid','نادرست / احمقانه','spoken & written','ideas, opinions , statements etc that are not true or that seem very stupid','[ singular, uncountable ]',null,'حرف بی‌معنی، بی‌مزه؛ خرافه (حرف)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['complete/total nonsense Most of what has been written on this subject is complete nonsense.','utter/absolute nonsense (= complete nonsense ) He said that the charges against him were absolute nonsense.','talk nonsense That''s not true - he''s talking nonsense!','believe this/that nonsense Don’t tell me you believe all this nonsense about ghosts!','that''s nonsense (= used to emphasize that something is not true ) That’s nonsense. I never said that at all.','a load of nonsense informal (= things that are completely untrue ) What she told you was a load of nonsense. Mark doesn’t drink at all.','a lot of nonsense (= things that are completely untrue ) ‘Don’t fill her head with a lot of nonsense, ’ said her mother.','stuff and nonsense old-fashioned (= nonsense ) When asked what he thought of astrology, he replied, ''Stuff and nonsense!''']::text[],'[{"sentence":"‘I’m a prisoner in my own home.’ ‘Nonsense!’","translation":"\"من در خانه خودم زندانی هستم.\" \"بیهوده!\"","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000245742.mp3"},{"sentence":"‘Nobody cares about me.’ ‘That’s absolute nonsense, Mary!’","translation":"\"هیچ کس به من اهمیت نمی دهد.\" \"این مزخرف مطلق است، مریم!\"","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001557036.mp3"},{"sentence":"all this nonsense about health foods","translation":"این همه مزخرف در مورد غذاهای سالم","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001557039.mp3"},{"sentence":"If you ask me, these modern teaching methods are a load of nonsense (= a lot of nonsense ) .","translation":"اگر از من بپرسید، این روش‌های آموزشی مدرن، انبوهی از مزخرفات هستند (= مزخرفات زیاد).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001557040.mp3"},{"sentence":"He was talking utter nonsense as usual.","translation":"طبق معمول داشت حرف مفت می زد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001557045.mp3"},{"sentence":"The government’s housing policy is a nonsense.","translation":"سیاست مسکن دولت مزخرف است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000245752.mp3"},{"sentence":"By 1832 the idea had become an economic nonsense.","translation":"در سال 1832 این ایده به یک پوچ اقتصادی تبدیل شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001557052.mp3"},{"sentence":"It is nonsense to say that mistakes are never made.","translation":"اینکه بگوییم اشتباه هرگز مرتکب نمی شود، بی معنی است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001760438.mp3"}]'::jsonb,8),
('28a087be-e8ce-5aa6-911c-3e1c5b22bb67','382b476e-76c8-5d60-8fb5-27ad6e79e387',2,'annoying behaviour','رفتار آزاردهنده','spoken & written','behaviour that is stupid and annoying','[ uncountable ]',null,'رفتار احمقانه و آزاردهنده','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['complete/total nonsense Most of what has been written on this subject is complete nonsense.','utter/absolute nonsense (= complete nonsense ) He said that the charges against him were absolute nonsense.','talk nonsense That''s not true - he''s talking nonsense!','believe this/that nonsense Don’t tell me you believe all this nonsense about ghosts!','that''s nonsense (= used to emphasize that something is not true ) That’s nonsense. I never said that at all.','a load of nonsense informal (= things that are completely untrue ) What she told you was a load of nonsense. Mark doesn’t drink at all.','a lot of nonsense (= things that are completely untrue ) ‘Don’t fill her head with a lot of nonsense, ’ said her mother.','stuff and nonsense old-fashioned (= nonsense ) When asked what he thought of astrology, he replied, ''Stuff and nonsense!''']::text[],'[{"sentence":"You’re to stop that nonsense , do you hear me?","translation":"تو باید جلوی این مزخرفات را بگیری، صدایم را می شنوی؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000245766.mp3"},{"sentence":"She won’t stand any nonsense from the kids in her class.","translation":"او هیچ حرف مزخرفی را از طرف بچه های کلاسش تحمل نمی کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000245770.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
