('5db63f7b-4c1a-597a-89cc-72e8c246fb17','ae826c8b-fff6-5e08-8630-5bab76431ede',1,null,null,'spoken & written','ideas and activities relating to gaining and using power in a country, city etc','[ uncountable ]',null,'سیاست، سیاست‌بازی؛ سیاست (علم)؛ سیاست (فرد)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['national politics Mark had always been keen to have a career in national politics.','local politics Ann is very active in local politics.','international politics The two superpowers that dominated international politics.','world/global politics There was much going on in world politics at the time.','domestic politics (= within a country ) The war had a major impact on the country’s domestic politics.','party politics (= trying to make your party successful ) He believes that party politics has no place in local government.','power politics (= attempting to get power by using or threatening to use force ) The party argued that power politics would always lead to war.','be involved in politics After university, he became involved in local politics.','take part in politics Young people should be encouraged to take part in politics.','be active in politics (= be involved in ) I was very active in politics before I retired.','interfere/meddle in politics He warned the army against interfering in politics.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"a good understanding of politics in China","translation":"درک خوبی از سیاست در چین","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001574135.mp3"},{"sentence":"modern American politics","translation":"سیاست مدرن آمریکا","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000346042.mp3"},{"sentence":"Politics have always interested Anita.","translation":"سیاست همیشه به آنیتا علاقه داشته است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000346047.mp3"},{"sentence":"Brooke’s been involved in city politics since college.","translation":"بروک از زمان کالج درگیر سیاست شهری بود.","audio_url":"https: