('03f7e119-937b-5a7d-98b8-a8ae971cb88e','ae826c8b-fff6-5e08-8630-5bab76431ede',4,null,null,'spoken & written','someone’s political beliefs and opinions','[ plural ]',null,'عقاید و عقاید سیاسی کسی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['national politics Mark had always been keen to have a career in national politics.','local politics Ann is very active in local politics.','international politics The two superpowers that dominated international politics.','world/global politics There was much going on in world politics at the time.','domestic politics (= within a country ) The war had a major impact on the country’s domestic politics.','party politics (= trying to make your party successful ) He believes that party politics has no place in local government.','power politics (= attempting to get power by using or threatening to use force ) The party argued that power politics would always lead to war.','be involved in politics After university, he became involved in local politics.','take part in politics Young people should be encouraged to take part in politics.','be active in politics (= be involved in ) I was very active in politics before I retired.','interfere/meddle in politics He warned the army against interfering in politics.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"I assume her politics must be fairly conservative.","translation":"من فرض می کنم سیاست او باید نسبتاً محافظه کارانه باشد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000346067.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('cca0d741-7035-5f2d-b431-99c3f3d648ee','ae826c8b-fff6-5e08-8630-5bab76431ede',5,null,null,'spoken & written','the study of political power and systems of government','[ uncountable ]',null,'مطالعه قدرت سیاسی و نظام های حکومتی',array['political science']::text[],'{}'::text[],array['national politics Mark had always been keen to have a career in national politics.','local politics Ann is very active in local politics.','international politics The two superpowers that dominated international politics.','world/global politics There was much going on in world politics at the time.','domestic politics (= within a country ) The war had a major impact on the country’s domestic politics.','party politics (= trying to make your party successful ) He believes that party politics has no place in local government.','power politics (= attempting to get power by using or threatening to use force ) The party argued that power politics would always lead to war.','be involved in politics After university, he became involved in local politics.','take part in politics Young people should be encouraged to take part in politics.','be active in politics (= be involved in ) I was very active in politics before I retired.','interfere/meddle in politics He warned the army against interfering in politics.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Tom is studying for a degree in politics.","translation":"تام در حال تحصیل در رشته سیاست است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000346073.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('10fc660b-5d2c-5385-bb8d-b243a8b8004c','b7eabb12-fb3f-5c5b-ad93-851263607cb3',1,'way of standing/sitting etc','نحوه ایستادن/نشستن و غیره','spoken & written','the way someone is standing, sitting, or lying','[ countable ]',null,'حالت، وضعیت؛ وضعیت (نشستن)؛ سمت (شغل)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a comfortable position She wriggled into a more comfortable position.','an awkward position My foot was in an awkward position.','a sitting/kneeling/standing position The priest rose from his kneeling position by the bed.','a foetal position (= in which you are curled up like a baby before it is born ) I crawled into my bed and curled up in a foetal position.','change/shift your position He shifted his position to get a better view of the stage.','pull/drag/haul yourself into a position She pulled herself into a sitting position.','assume/adopt a position formal (= move your body into a particular position ) The patient should adopt this position for five minutes every half hour.','hold a position (= stay in a position ) Pull in your tummy muscles and hold that position.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Lie in a comfortable position .","translation":"در یک موقعیت راحت دراز بکشید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000311288.mp3"},{"sentence":"Frankie shifted his position so that his knees would not become cramped.","translation":"فرانکی موقعیت خود را تغییر داد تا زانوهایش گرفتگی نکنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001576405.mp3"},{"sentence":"I struggled up into a sitting position.","translation":"به سختی به حالت نشسته رسیدم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000311291.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('55a7ab8d-3537-574e-9e63-c983c13c2af9','b7eabb12-fb3f-5c5b-ad93-851263607cb3',2,'situation','وضعیت','spoken & written','the situation that someone is in, especially when this affects what they can and cannot do','[ countable usually singular ]',null,'موقعیتی که یک نفر در آن قرار دارد، به خصوص زمانی که این بر کارهایی که او می تواند و نمی تواند انجام دهد تأثیر می گذارد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"I’m not sure what I would do if I were in your position .","translation":"مطمئن نیستم اگر جای شما بودم چه کار می کردم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-002007732.mp3"},{"sentence":"Next week we will be in a much better position to comment.","translation":"هفته آینده ما در موقعیت بسیار بهتری برای اظهار نظر خواهیم بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-002007742.mp3"},{"sentence":"She is in the enviable position of having three job offers.","translation":"او با داشتن سه پیشنهاد شغلی در موقعیت غبطه‌انگیز است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-002007748.mp3"},{"sentence":"You’re putting me in rather a difficult position.","translation":"شما مرا در موقعیت نسبتاً سختی قرار می دهید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-002007752.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('36d30911-65f5-5e3b-a686-b20d1ac9e734','b7eabb12-fb3f-5c5b-ad93-851263607cb3',3,'place where somebody/something is','جایی که کسی/چیزی است','spoken & written','the place where someone or something is, especially in relation to other objects and places','[ countable ]',null,'جایی که کسی یا چیزی در آن است، به ویژه در رابطه با اشیاء و مکان های دیگر','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"the position of the sun in the sky","translation":"موقعیت خورشید در آسمان","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001763407.mp3"},{"sentence":"Our hotel was in a superb central position near St Mark’s Square.","translation":"هتل ما در یک موقعیت مرکزی عالی در نزدیکی میدان سنت مارک قرار داشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000311349.mp3"},{"sentence":"the strategic position (= useful or important position ) of Egypt in relation to the Arabian peninsula","translation":"موقعیت استراتژیک (= موقعیت مفید یا مهم) مصر در رابطه با شبه جزیره عربستان","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001763414.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('fb38e102-9fca-5eb4-97ec-070662460526','b7eabb12-fb3f-5c5b-ad93-851263607cb3',4,'correct place','مکان صحیح','spoken & written','the place where someone or something is needed or supposed to be','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'جایی که کسی یا چیزی مورد نیاز یا قرار است باشد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"He pulled the ladder into position.","translation":"نردبان را به موقعیت خود کشید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001576428.mp3"},{"sentence":"All parking signs have now been placed in position.","translation":"همه علائم پارکینگ در حال حاضر در موقعیت خود قرار داده شده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000311361.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('7fa7ebdc-9726-5710-beea-e2cd1c80c472','b7eabb12-fb3f-5c5b-ad93-851263607cb3',5,'direction','جهت','spoken & written','the direction in which an object is pointing','[ countable ]',null,'جهتی که یک جسم در آن قرار دارد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Make sure the container remains in an upright position.","translation":"مطمئن شوید که ظرف در حالت عمودی باقی می ماند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001763422.mp3"},{"sentence":"She turned the switch to the ‘on’ position.","translation":"سوئیچ را روی حالت «روشن» قرار داد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001763423.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('32b0dd56-849b-5de1-b1ef-8c8f920e4491','b7eabb12-fb3f-5c5b-ad93-851263607cb3',6,'opinion','نظر','spoken & written','an opinion or judgment on a particular subject, especially the official opinion of a government, a political party, or someone in authority','[ countable ]',null,'یک نظر یا قضاوت در مورد یک موضوع خاص، به ویژه نظر رسمی یک دولت، یک حزب سیاسی، یا یک مقام مسئول',array['attitude']::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"What’s the party’s position on tax reform?","translation":"موضع حزب در مورد اصلاحات مالیاتی چیست؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000311336.mp3"},{"sentence":"The principal took the position that the students didn’t need music classes.","translation":"مدیر این موضع را گرفت که دانش آموزان نیازی به کلاس های موسیقی ندارند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001576437.mp3"},{"sentence":"I hope you’ll reconsider your position .","translation":"امیدوارم در موضع خود تجدید نظر کنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001576441.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('7aa21f68-0f51-5540-9411-fec27ffe8918','b7eabb12-fb3f-5c5b-ad93-851263607cb3',7,'job','شغل','formal','a job','[ countable ]',null,'یک شغل','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Bill took up his new position as Works Director in October.","translation":"بیل پست جدید خود را به عنوان مدیر کار در اکتبر آغاز کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001576448.mp3"},{"sentence":"She has held the position of Chief Financial Officer since 1992.","translation":"او از سال 1992 سمت مدیر مالی را برعهده داشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001576451.mp3"},{"sentence":"Bruce is thinking of applying for the position .","translation":"بروس در فکر درخواست برای این موقعیت است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001576457.mp3"},{"sentence":"I’m sorry, the position has been filled (= someone has been found to do the job ) .","translation":"متاسفم، موقعیت پر شد (= کسی پیدا شد که کار را انجام دهد).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001763430.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('fcb576a5-5a7d-58af-89f2-98ed441b903b','b7eabb12-fb3f-5c5b-ad93-851263607cb3',8,'level/rank','سطح/رتبه','spoken & written','someone’s or something’s level, authority, or importance in a society or organization','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'سطح، اختیار یا اهمیت شخص یا چیزی در یک جامعه یا سازمان','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"the position of women in society","translation":"جایگاه زن در جامعه","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000311318.mp3"},{"sentence":"Many of his supporters used their positions of power for personal advantage.","translation":"بسیاری از حامیان او از موقعیت های قدرت خود برای منافع شخصی استفاده کردند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001576463.mp3"},{"sentence":"As a priest, he was in a position of trust .","translation":"به عنوان یک کشیش، او در موقعیت اعتماد قرار داشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001576464.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
