('4f0cbdc9-a781-565c-a020-a6e035f20369','df075b27-8dfc-5fd8-b1dc-c92585ef68b8',4,'made earlier','قبلا ساخته شده است','spoken & written','planned, made, or written at an earlier time, so that it is ready when it is needed',null,null,'در زمان قبلی برنامه ریزی شده، ساخته شده یا نوشته شده است، به طوری که در صورت نیاز آماده شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The president read out a prepared statement .","translation":"رئیس جمهور بیانیه آماده شده را قرائت کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001568697.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('cef46ec2-3f80-5019-83ca-a5b631bfbb63','981bb56e-ad35-5f88-9817-3d0a00859ece',1,null,null,'spoken & written','when someone or something is present in a particular place','[ uncountable ]',null,'حضور، وجود (در مکان)؛ حاضر (نشست)؛ هاله (نور)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['indicate the presence of something/somebody These plants indicate the presence of underground water.','reveal the presence of something/somebody Excavations revealed the presence of an ancient burial ground.','detect the presence of something/somebody They invented a device for detecting the presence of submarines.','confirm the presence of something/somebody Tests confirmed the presence of an infection.','explain the presence of something/somebody How could he possibly explain the presence of so much money in his flat?','notice somebody''s presence If he had noticed her presence, he gave no sign.','sense somebody''s presence (= be aware that someone is present without seeing them ) The man sensed his presence at once and turned sharply.','acknowledge somebody''s presence (= speak to someone or make a sign to show that you know they are present ) He acknowledged my presence with a quick wave.','be/become aware of somebody''s presence It was only when I coughed that he became aware of my presence.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Your presence is requested at the club meeting on Friday.","translation":"حضور شما در جلسه روز جمعه باشگاه درخواست می شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001766223.mp3"},{"sentence":"Tests revealed the presence of poison in the blood.","translation":"آزمایشات وجود سم را در خون نشان داد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001766226.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('585ea965-20b6-53e5-bd19-8db93a67f992','981bb56e-ad35-5f88-9817-3d0a00859ece',2,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'in the presence of somebody','حضور، وجود (در مکان)؛ حاضر (نشست)؛ هاله (نور)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['indicate the presence of something/somebody These plants indicate the presence of underground water.','reveal the presence of something/somebody Excavations revealed the presence of an ancient burial ground.','detect the presence of something/somebody They invented a device for detecting the presence of submarines.','confirm the presence of something/somebody Tests confirmed the presence of an infection.','explain the presence of something/somebody How could he possibly explain the presence of so much money in his flat?','notice somebody''s presence If he had noticed her presence, he gave no sign.','sense somebody''s presence (= be aware that someone is present without seeing them ) The man sensed his presence at once and turned sharply.','acknowledge somebody''s presence (= speak to someone or make a sign to show that you know they are present ) He acknowledged my presence with a quick wave.','be/become aware of somebody''s presence It was only when I coughed that he became aware of my presence.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
