لا به شدت بر فراز اقیانوس اطلس در حال ایجاد است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001561154.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('2b51878a-d704-57fe-ad52-51cef28d07ac','04d43868-eae9-53ee-bd71-cab3a88ab253',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to try to make someone do something by making them feel it is their duty to do it',null,null,'تلاش برای وادار کردن کسی به انجام کاری با این که احساس کند انجام آن وظیفه اوست','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"You want to enjoy food, not to be pressured into eating the right things.","translation":"شما می خواهید از غذا لذت ببرید، نه اینکه تحت فشار قرار بگیرید تا چیزهای مناسب بخورید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001561160.mp3"},{"sentence":"Don’t feel we are pressuring you to give what you can’t afford.","translation":"احساس نکنید که ما به شما فشار می آوریم تا آنچه را که نمی توانید بپردازید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001561163.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('b5bf6e66-8b63-5998-b334-c53ca1c14a5e','28786289-a172-5ed7-bc8e-5ae93f424cdf',1,null,null,'spoken & written','having happened or existed before the event , time, or thing that you are talking about now','[ only before noun ]',null,'قبلی، پیش‌تر؛ سابق (شغل)؛ گذشته (تاریخچه)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"I’ve met him before on two previous occasions.","translation":"من قبلاً در دو مورد قبلی با او ملاقات کردم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000290454.mp3"},{"sentence":"She has two children from a previous marriage.","translation":"او از ازدواج قبلی دو فرزند دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000290455.mp3"},{"sentence":"Do you have any previous experience of this type of work?","translation":"آیا تجربه قبلی از این نوع کار را دارید؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001583697.mp3"},{"sentence":"The lawyer told the judge that Kennedy had no previous convictions.","translation":"وکیل به قاضی گفت که کندی سابقه محکومیت قبلی نداشته است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001583701.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('cce4ef7d-84c2-5093-90fa-2b22657ebc9a','28786289-a172-5ed7-bc8e-5ae93f424cdf',2,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'the previous day/chapter/owner etc','قبلی، پیش‌تر؛ سابق (شغل)؛ گذشته (تاریخچه)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('fe37681b-3d0b-5660-9f56-0830d5bc6485','28786289-a172-5ed7-bc8e-5ae93f424cdf',3,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'previous to something','قبلی، پیش‌تر؛ سابق (شغل)؛ گذشته (تاریخچه)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('e5d9339f-aab7-5c48-86db-1f4c0b2d110d','39ed6cd8-577b-58bb-9097-c83b56909ecd',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a close female relation of a king and queen , especially a daughter',null,null,'شاهدخت، خانم شاهزاده','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Princess Anne","translation":"پرنسس آن","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000292047.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('ce4c1672-6826-5920-b796-3edab278219c','39ed6cd8-577b-58bb-9097-c83b56909ecd',2,null,null,'spoken & written','the wife of a prince',null,null,'همسر یک شاهزاده','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('477bc0a9-597a-5e0d-a44a-808683d93aae','44f68fae-eecc-56b0-8a9a-d1351c60266c',1,null,null,'spoken & written','the thing that you think is most important and that needs attention before anything else','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'اولویت، پیشتازی؛ اولویت (کار)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a high priority (= very important ) Right now, the environment is a high priority.','an urgent priority He sees these negotiations as an urgent priority.','a low priority (= not very important ) At that time, architecture was a low priority.','the top/main/number one priority Controlling spending is his top priority.','the first priority The first priority for most unemployed people is obtaining a job.','the overriding priority (= the most important one ) The reduction of inflation must be the Government’s overriding priority.','somebody’s immediate priority (= which must be dealt with immediately ) Their immediate priority was to find somewhere to sleep that night.','a list/set of priorities Marriage isn’t very high on my list of priorities.','in order of priority (= with the most important first ) They asked voters to list issues in order of priority.','set priorities (= decide what the priorities are ) With any new project, it''s important to set priorities.','sort out your priorities (= decide which things are the most important as a way of dealing with a situation ) If you’ve got a lot of things to do, sort out your priorities.','make something a priority Lisa had a job, but she''d always made her family the priority.','somebody’s priorities change As you get older, your priorities may change.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The club’s priority is to win the League.","translation":"اولویت باشگاه قهرمانی در لیگ است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000293492.mp3"},{"sentence":"The children are our first priority.","translation":"بچه ها اولویت اول ما هستند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001568851.mp3"},{"sentence":"After several burglaries in the area, security is now a high priority (= very important and needing attention soon ) .","translation":"پس از چندین سرقت در منطقه، اکنون امنیت در اولویت قرار دارد (= بسیار مهم و به زودی نیاز به توجه دارد).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000293497.mp3"},{"sentence":"With so little money available, repairs must remain a low priority (= not important and not needing attention soon ) .","translation":"با وجود پول بسیار کم، تعمیرات باید در اولویت کم باقی بماند (= مهم نیست و به زودی نیاز به توجه ندارد).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001568862.mp3"},{"sentence":"The customer is high on our list of priorities .","translation":"مشتری در لیست اولویت های ما قرار دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001568863.mp3"},{"sentence":"List your tasks in order of priority (= most important first ) .","translation":"وظایف خود را به ترتیب اولویت (= اول مهمترین) فهرست کنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001568870.mp3"}]'::jsonb,6),
('4bba08ab-0939-5a1a-b9cc-650bd72c49bf','44f68fae-eecc-56b0-8a9a-d1351c60266c',2,null,null,'spoken & written','the right to be given attention first and before other people or things','[ uncountable ]',null,'حق توجه اول و قبل از افراد یا چیزهای دیگر','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Buses should have priority over other road users.","translation":"اتوبوس ها باید نسبت به سایر کاربران جاده اولویت داشته باشند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001568872.mp3"},{"sentence":"A young person who has finished the course will be given priority over one who has not.","translation":"جوانی که دوره را تمام کرده است نسبت به جوانی که این دوره را گذرانده در اولویت است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001568876.mp3"},{"sentence":"I want to start work on the garden but the house must take priority .","translation":"من می خواهم کار باغ را شروع کنم اما خانه باید در اولویت باشد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001568880.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('fef2a6d7-de7c-5d4f-9f9d-483536c2ad76','44f68fae-eecc-56b0-8a9a-d1351c60266c',3,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'get your priorities right','اولویت، پیشتازی؛ اولویت (کار)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('3fc26036-d80e-5672-a947-ab584635b9b8','e40f1423-dd50-57b4-8702-5eb4e36604ae',1,null,null,'spoken & written','before other people or things',null,null,'قبل از افراد یا چیزهای دیگر','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Members receive priority bookings and reduced ticket prices to all concerts.","translation":"اعضا رزروهای اولویت دار و کاهش قیمت بلیط همه کنسرت ها را دریافت می کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001568796.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('0cdf06b6-f60c-5e9a-af6d-54e67a595601','c03e0c4a-2e61-570b-98c2-9bef835e59cb',1,null,null,'spoken & written','someone who is kept in a prison as a legal punishment for a crime or while they are waiting for their trial',null,null,'زندانی، حبس‌شده؛ اسیر (جنگی)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a remand prisoner British English (= one who is waiting for their trial ) A prison governor is refusing to accept any more remand prisoners.','a condemned prisoner (= one who is going to be punished by being killed ) There is an appeal process for condemned prisoners.','a political prisoner (= one who is in prison because of their political opinions ) They demanded that the military government free all political prisoners.','an escaped prisoner Soldiers arrived, looking for escaped prisoners.','release/free a prisoner Hundreds of prisoners were released.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Relationships between the staff and the prisoners are good.","translation":"روابط بین کارکنان و زندانیان خوب است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000293649.mp3"},{"sentence":"Prisoners here only serve short sentences.","translation":"زندانیان اینجا فقط محکومیت های کوتاهی می گذرانند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001568942.mp3"},{"sentence":"The organization is arguing for the release of political prisoners (= people in prison because of their political opinions ) .","translation":"این سازمان برای آزادی زندانیان سیاسی (= افراد در زندان به دلیل عقاید سیاسی خود) بحث می کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001568952.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('155f9138-1261-5a17-8c02-3ce26ed3dfef','c03e0c4a-2e61-570b-98c2-9bef835e59cb',2,null,null,'spoken & written','someone who is taken by force and kept somewhere',null,null,'کسی که به زور او را می برند و در جایی نگه می دارند',array['captive']::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a remand prisoner British English (= one who is waiting for their trial ) A prison governor is refusing to accept any more remand prisoners.','a condemned prisoner (= one who is going to be punished by being killed ) There is an appeal process for condemned prisoners.','a political prisoner (= one who is in prison because of their political opinions ) They demanded that the military government free all political prisoners.','an escaped prisoner Soldiers arrived, looking for escaped prisoners.','release/free a prisoner Hundreds of prisoners were released.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The guerrillas kept her prisoner for three months.","translation":"چریک ها او را سه ماه اسیر نگه داشتند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa020188.mp3"},{"sentence":"He was being held prisoner.","translation":"او زندانی بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001568957.mp3"},{"sentence":"Our pilot was taken prisoner .","translation":"خلبان ما اسیر شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001568964.mp3"},{"sentence":"The army advanced, taking 200,000 prisoners .","translation":"ارتش پیشروی کرد و 200000 اسیر گرفت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001568958.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('4b38ff80-a73f-54cf-9db0-f2b3caacc934','c03e0c4a-2e61-570b-98c2-9bef835e59cb',3,null,null,'spoken & written','someone who is in a place or situation from which they cannot escape',null,null,'کسی که در مکان یا موقعیتی قرار دارد که نمی تواند از آن فرار کند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a remand prisoner British English (= one who is waiting for their trial ) A prison governor is refusing to accept any more remand prisoners.','a condemned prisoner (= one who is going to be punished by being killed ) There is an appeal process for condemned prisoners.','a political prisoner (= one who is in prison because of their political opinions ) They demanded that the military government free all political prisoners.','an escaped prisoner Soldiers arrived, looking for escaped prisoners.','release/free a prisoner Hundreds of prisoners were released.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"He is a prisoner of his own past.","translation":"او زندانی گذشته خودش است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001568970.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('140a3053-2115-5869-bb8b-f83aa3c2b1a0','361e4b7b-0b8a-533c-b53a-0e63f7f93949',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a British television series about a man who is made to live in a strange village . He is called ‘number six’ and says ‘I am not a number. I am a free man’. The head man in the village is ‘number two’, and the relationship between them and the whole situation, are very mysterious . The Prisoner, made in 1967–68, is still popular, with the sign connected with the programme , an old-fashioned bicycle called a penny-farthing , still being recognized .',null,null,'یک سریال تلویزیونی بریتانیایی در مورد مردی که در دهکده ای عجیب زندگی می کند. او را "شماره شش" می نامند و می گوید "من یک عدد نیستم". من یک مرد آزاد هستم. رئیس دهکده «شماره دو» است و رابطه بین آنها و کل وضعیت بسیار مرموز است. The Prisoner که در سالهای 1967-1968 ساخته شد، هنوز هم محبوب است، با علامت مرتبط با این برنامه، دوچرخه ای قدیمی به نام پنی فرتینگ، که هنوز شناخته شده است.','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('3a026307-e203-54fa-857c-1a5a366021c5','7d493d50-f7fb-5dc7-9911-e4bdf9366fed',1,null,null,'spoken & written','used to say that something is likely to happen, likely to be true etc','[ sentence adverb ]',null,'احتمالاً، به احتمال زیاد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"It will probably take about a week.","translation":"احتمالا حدود یک هفته طول خواهد کشید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000294706.mp3"},{"sentence":"This would probably be a good time to take a break.","translation":"این احتمالا زمان خوبی برای استراحت خواهد بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000294707.mp3"},{"sentence":"It’s probably the best movie I have ever seen.","translation":"این احتمالا بهترین فیلمی است که تا به حال دیده ام.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001569149.mp3"},{"sentence":"‘Are you going to be able to do this?’ ‘Yes, probably.’","translation":"«آیا می‌توانید این کار را انجام دهید؟» «بله، احتمالاً.»","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000294708.mp3"},{"sentence":"‘Is she going to send it back?’ ‘ Probably not , no.’","translation":"«آیا او آن را پس می‌فرستد؟» «احتمالاً نه، نه.»","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001569150.mp3"},{"sentence":"The building will be replaced, most probably by a modern sports centre.","translation":"این ساختمان احتمالاً با یک مرکز ورزشی مدرن جایگزین خواهد شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000294711.mp3"}]'::jsonb,6),
('34fc3de4-5796-557d-bbf9-fa5d0b53b177','193af6ce-6954-5562-8d3c-db5a80ea470f',1,null,null,'spoken & written','someone whose job is to control the preparation of a play, film , or broadcast , but who does not direct the actors',null,null,'تهیه‌کننده، تولیدکننده (فیلم)؛ تهیه‌کننده (موسیقی)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Hollywood producers and movie stars","translation":"تهیه کنندگان هالیوود و ستاره های سینما","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001561502.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('6ccf9d4e-5757-517f-8c90-8704a51cfa7e','193af6ce-6954-5562-8d3c-db5a80ea470f',2,null,null,'spoken & written','someone whose job is to organize and direct the recording and production of a record',null,null,'کسی که کارش سازماندهی و هدایت ضبط و تولید یک رکورد است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('e1fc813e-15e3-5db4-816a-c4bae167a10c','193af6ce-6954-5562-8d3c-db5a80ea470f',3,null,null,'spoken & written','a person, company, or country that makes or grows goods, foods, or materials',null,null,'شخص، شرکت یا کشوری که کالاها، غذاها یا مواد را تولید یا پرورش می دهد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"South Carolina is the fourth largest producer of tobacco.","translation":"کارولینای جنوبی چهارمین تولیدکننده بزرگ تنباکو است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000297946.mp3"},{"sentence":"leading oil producers","translation":"تولیدکنندگان پیشرو نفت","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001765881.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('15840183-3ada-5509-8959-4c31216b569e','36e4d5df-c15b-5879-a610-5827ede93c32',1,null,null,'spoken & written','the process of getting better at doing something, or getting closer to finishing or achieving something',null,null,'پیشرفت، پیشرفت‌های (تدریجی)؛ مسیر (پیشروی)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['make progress The country has made significant economic progress.','hinder somebody’s progress (= make it slower ) Language problems might hinder a child’s progress at school.','achieve progress The talks ended with no real progress having been achieved.','check (on) somebody’s progress A social worker calls regularly to check on the children’s progress.','follow/monitor/chart somebody’s progress (= keep checking it ) Throughout the night, doctors charted his progress.','assess/evaluate/review somebody’s progress We appraise the work and evaluate each student’s individual progress.','slow The task remains difficult and progress has been slow.','steady Steady progress has been made towards our objectives.','good He is out of hospital and making good progress.','rapid The investigation is making rapid progress.','significant/real progress Significant progress has been made in reducing nuclear weapons.','great progress Scientists have made great progress in the last four years.','substantial/considerable progress 2007 was a year of substantial progress for the company.','satisfactory progress The two students who fell behind are now making satisfactory progress.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The police are disappointed by the slow progress of the investigation.","translation":"پلیس از پیشرفت کند تحقیقات ناامید شده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001252.mp3"},{"sentence":"There has been significant progress in controlling heart disease.","translation":"پیشرفت قابل توجهی در کنترل بیماری قلبی صورت گرفته است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001253.mp3"},{"sentence":"We are making steady progress towards a peaceful settlement.","translation":"ما در حال پیشرفت مداوم به سوی یک راه حل مسالمت آمیز هستیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001254.mp3"},{"sentence":"Little progress has been made on human rights issues.","translation":"پیشرفت کمی در زمینه حقوق بشر حاصل شده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001582877.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('21e2d57f-acd1-5ba1-b648-c69629666f19','36e4d5df-c15b-5879-a610-5827ede93c32',2,null,null,'spoken & written','slow or steady movement somewhere',null,null,'حرکت آهسته یا پیوسته در جایی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['make progress The country has made significant economic progress.','hinder somebody’s progress (= make it slower ) Language problems might hinder a child’s progress at school.','achieve progress The talks ended with no real progress having been achieved.','check (on) somebody’s progress A social worker calls regularly to check on the children’s progress.','follow/monitor/chart somebody’s progress (= keep checking it ) Throughout the night, doctors charted his progress.','assess/evaluate/review somebody’s progress We appraise the work and evaluate each student’s individual progress.','slow The task remains difficult and progress has been slow.','steady Steady progress has been made towards our objectives.','good He is out of hospital and making good progress.','rapid The investigation is making rapid progress.','significant/real progress Significant progress has been made in reducing nuclear weapons.','great progress Scientists have made great progress in the last four years.','substantial/considerable progress 2007 was a year of substantial progress for the company.','satisfactory progress The two students who fell behind are now making satisfactory progress.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"We made good progress despite the snow.","translation":"با وجود برف پیشرفت خوبی داشتیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001582900.mp3"},{"sentence":"They watched the ship’s slow progress through the heavy seas.","translation":"آنها پیشرفت آهسته کشتی را در دریاهای سنگین تماشا کردند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001582906.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('eb059f4c-9dcb-5d81-ad9f-55ce470a3f99','36e4d5df-c15b-5879-a610-5827ede93c32',3,null,null,'spoken & written','change which is thought to lead to a better society , because of developments in science or fairer methods of social organization',null,null,'تغییری که تصور می‌شود به دلیل پیشرفت علم یا روش‌های عادلانه‌تر سازمان‌دهی اجتماعی منجر به جامعه بهتری شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['make progress The country has made significant economic progress.','hinder somebody’s progress (= make it slower ) Language problems might hinder a child’s progress at school.','achieve progress The talks ended with no real progress having been achieved.','check (on) somebody’s progress A social worker calls regularly to check on the children’s progress.','follow/monitor/chart somebody’s progress (= keep checking it ) Throughout the night, doctors charted his progress.','assess/evaluate/review somebody’s progress We appraise the work and evaluate each student’s individual progress.','slow The task remains difficult and progress has been slow.','steady Steady progress has been made towards our objectives.','good He is out of hospital and making good progress.','rapid The investigation is making rapid progress.','significant/real progress Significant progress has been made in reducing nuclear weapons.','great progress Scientists have made great progress in the last four years.','substantial/considerable progress 2007 was a year of substantial progress for the company.','satisfactory progress The two students who fell behind are now making satisfactory progress.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Mankind is destroying the planet, all in the name of progress (= because people want progress ) .","translation":"بشریت در حال نابود کردن سیاره است، همه به نام پیشرفت (= چون مردم پیشرفت می خواهند).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001941976.mp3"},{"sentence":"Under communism, nothing was allowed to get in the way of the great march of progress .","translation":"در زمان کمونیسم، هیچ چیز اجازه نداشت که مانع راهپیمایی بزرگ پیشرفت شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001941981.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('71b2759e-9150-5c0b-9f80-ba6d14c50019','36e4d5df-c15b-5879-a610-5827ede93c32',4,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'in progress','پیشرفت، پیشرفت‌های (تدریجی)؛ مسیر (پیشروی)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['make progress The country has made significant economic progress.','hinder somebody’s progress (= make it slower ) Language problems might hinder a child’s progress at school.','achieve progress The talks ended with no real progress having been achieved.','check (on) somebody’s progress A social worker calls regularly to check on the children’s progress.','follow/monitor/chart somebody’s progress (= keep checking it ) Throughout the night, doctors charted his progress.','assess/evaluate/review somebody’s progress We appraise the work and evaluate each student’s individual progress.','slow The task remains difficult and progress has been slow.','steady Steady progress has been made towards our objectives.','good He is out of hospital and making good progress.','rapid The investigation is making rapid progress.','significant/real progress Significant progress has been made in reducing nuclear weapons.','great progress Scientists have made great progress in the last four years.','substantial/considerable progress 2007 was a year of substantial progress for the company.','satisfactory progress The two students who fell behind are now making satisfactory progress.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('83d9f190-52e1-5263-94dc-b28038f34dab','9c0a233d-697e-53e5-a2d3-6f1040caf81f',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to improve, develop , or achieve things so that you are then at a more advanced stage','[ intransitive ]',null,'برای بهبود، توسعه یا دستیابی به چیزهایی به طوری که در مرحله پیشرفته تری قرار بگیرید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"I asked the nurse how my son was progressing.","translation":"از پرستار پرسیدم پسرم چگونه پیشرفت می کند؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000299390.mp3"},{"sentence":"She started with a cleaning job, and progressed to running the company.","translation":"او با یک کار نظافتی شروع کرد و تا اداره شرکت پیش رفت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000299407.mp3"},{"sentence":"We must progress towards full integration of Catholic and Protestant pupils in Ireland.","translation":"ما باید به سمت ادغام کامل دانش آموزان کاتولیک و پروتستان در ایرلند پیشرفت کنیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001582910.mp3"},{"sentence":"Last year the team didn’t progress beyond the opening round.","translation":"سال گذشته تیم فراتر از دور افتتاحیه پیشرفت نکرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001582913.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('b61c6ca8-e1b0-550c-8e4b-58a5f08c30c6','9c0a233d-697e-53e5-a2d3-6f1040caf81f',2,null,null,'spoken & written','if an activity such as work or a project progresses, or you progress it, it continues','[ intransitive, transitive ]',null,'اگر فعالیتی مانند کار یا پروژه ای پیشرفت کند یا شما آن را پیشرفت دهید، ادامه می یابد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Work on the ship progressed quickly.","translation":"کار روی کشتی به سرعت پیشرفت کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000299397.mp3"},{"sentence":"We’re hoping to progress the Lane project more quickly next week.","translation":"امیدواریم هفته آینده پروژه لین را با سرعت بیشتری پیش ببریم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-002008511.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('651dc488-1234-5bd2-93ec-f1d169dbf7ce','9c0a233d-697e-53e5-a2d3-6f1040caf81f',3,null,null,'spoken & written','if time or an event progresses, time passes','[ intransitive ]',null,'اگر زمان یا رویدادی پیشرفت کند، زمان می گذرد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"As the meeting progressed, Nina grew more and more bored.","translation":"با پیشرفت جلسه، نینا بیشتر و بیشتر خسته می شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001582916.mp3"},{"sentence":"Time is progressing, so I’ll be brief.","translation":"زمان در حال پیشرفت است، بنابراین من مختصر خواهم بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001582917.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('1d5bd1f3-3010-5545-919a-8d18a026331d','9c0a233d-697e-53e5-a2d3-6f1040caf81f',4,null,null,'spoken & written','to move forward','[ intransitive ]',null,'برای حرکت به جلو','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Our taxi seemed to be progressing very slowly.","translation":"تاکسی ما انگار خیلی کند پیش می رفت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000299401.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('d8280919-7d20-5963-94c8-e0b2aa21912f','8467daa5-986a-5403-84ab-9d305250017d',1,null,null,'spoken & written','correctly, or in a way that is considered right',null,null,'درست، صحیح (حالت)؛ به‌طور کامل (بررسی)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The brakes don’t seem to be working properly.","translation":"به نظر می رسد که ترمزها به درستی کار نمی کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001569263.mp3"},{"sentence":"Then he’s not doing his job properly.","translation":"سپس او کار خود را به درستی انجام نمی دهد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000302352.mp3"},{"sentence":"Parents should teach their children to behave properly in public.","translation":"والدین باید به فرزندان خود بیاموزند که در جمع رفتار کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000302354.mp3"},{"sentence":"properly trained staff","translation":"کارکنان به درستی آموزش دیده","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001569268.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('e6d0902e-4fca-55cf-9751-37e3f5d8dcd8','8467daa5-986a-5403-84ab-9d305250017d',2,null,null,'spoken & written','completely or fully',null,null,'به طور کامل یا کامل',array['thoroughly']::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Is the chicken properly defrosted?","translation":"آیا مرغ به درستی یخ زدایی شده است؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000302362.mp3"},{"sentence":"The allegations were never properly investigated.","translation":"این اتهامات هرگز به درستی مورد بررسی قرار نگرفت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001569270.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('b44844d4-a581-546d-985d-46dd5cbb0480','8467daa5-986a-5403-84ab-9d305250017d',3,null,null,'formal','really',null,null,'واقعا','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Documents properly belonging to the family were taken away.","translation":"اسنادی که به درستی متعلق به خانواده بود با خود برده شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000302366.mp3"},{"sentence":"It isn’t, properly speaking, a real science.","translation":"به بیان درست، این یک علم واقعی نیست.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000302372.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('b0a435f4-4aa9-56bd-85c9-d3f4f88779e2','8467daa5-986a-5403-84ab-9d305250017d',4,null,null,'spoken & written','used to say that someone is right to do something',null,null,'می گفت: کسی حق دارد کاری را انجام دهد',array['rightly']::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"People are, quite properly, proud of their homes.","translation":"مردم به درستی به خانه های خود افتخار می کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000302378.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('c5a491f8-77d3-5ada-8a3b-e1597a48d9f1','70498418-f6f8-5a9d-adeb-4de58e863f6b',1,null,null,'spoken & written','the thing or things that someone owns','[ uncountable ]',null,'دارایی، اموال؛ ویژگی (ماده)؛ املاک (سرمایه)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The hotel is not responsible for any loss or damage to guests’ personal property .","translation":"هتل هیچ مسئولیتی در قبال ضرر و زیان وارده به اموال شخصی مهمانان ندارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001569273.mp3"},{"sentence":"Some of the stolen property was found in Mason’s house.","translation":"مقداری از اموال مسروقه در خانه میسون پیدا شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000302431.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('40ecf92c-1655-5117-850d-440f197090b1','70498418-f6f8-5a9d-adeb-4de58e863f6b',2,null,null,'spoken & written','a building, a piece of land, or both together','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'یک ساختمان، یک قطعه زمین یا هر دو با هم','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['buy/sell (a) property Buying a property is a complicated business.','detached especially British English (= not joined to another house ) It is a modern detached property with five bedrooms.','semi-detached British English (= joined to one other house ) This semi-detached property is located in one of the most sought-after areas of the town.','a three-bedroom/four-bedroom etc property Four-bedroom properties are usually ideal for families.','a desirable property It is a desirable property with a south-facing garden.','commercial property (= buildings used by businesses ) The bombs caused damage to commercial property.','residential property (= buildings that people live in ) The site proposed for the factory is too near to residential property.','private property The land on the other side of the gate is private property.','property prices Property prices are much lower here than in London.','the property market There were no signs of an upturn in the property market.','a property owner It makes sense for property owners to extend their houses rather than move.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Property prices have shot up recently.","translation":"قیمت ملک اخیراً افزایش یافته است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000302437.mp3"},{"sentence":"the property market","translation":"بازار ملک","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001569281.mp3"},{"sentence":"a sign saying ‘ Private Property . Keep Out.’","translation":"تابلویی که می گوید \"مالکیت خصوصی\". بیرون نگه دارید.''","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001569284.mp3"},{"sentence":"property taxes","translation":"مالیات بر دارایی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001766952.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('c26d3b73-297f-5f5c-8465-66e1122d1086','70498418-f6f8-5a9d-adeb-4de58e863f6b',3,null,null,'spoken & written','a quality or power that a substance , plant etc has','[ countable usually plural ]',null,'کیفیت یا قدرتی که یک ماده، گیاه و غیره دارد',array['quality','characteristic']::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"a herb with healing properties","translation":"گیاهی با خواص درمانی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000302451.mp3"},{"sentence":"the chemical properties of a substance","translation":"خواص شیمیایی یک ماده","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000302452.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('d133dae8-2b6e-5a41-9997-c19079821c42','e2c740a8-4903-545d-981d-7041b7e9d47c',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a plan or suggestion which is made formally to an official person or group, or the act of making it',null,null,'پیشنهاد، طرح (رسمی)؛ پیشنهاد ازدواج؛ پیشنهاد (مالی)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['make a proposal I''d like to make a proposal.','put forward/submit a proposal They put forward a proposal for a joint research project.','come up with a proposal (= think of one ) The sales staff came up with an innovative proposal.','draw up a proposal A committee of experts drew up proposals for a constitution.','approve/accept a proposal The proposal was approved by the committee.','support/back a proposal Not one of these organizations supports the government''s proposals.','reject a proposal Councillors had twice rejected proposals for a new village school.','consider a proposal We shall consider their proposals carefully.','discuss a proposal He had discussed the proposal with the Egyptian president.','vote on a proposal Shareholders will vote on the proposal on May 5.','a detailed proposal They drew up a detailed proposal and submitted it to the Department of Energy.','a specific/concrete proposal The report will make specific proposals for further investigation.','a research proposal Applicants should submit a short research proposal on their chosen topic.','a budget/tax proposal (= a budget/tax plan ) Criticism of the budget proposals was voiced by the International Monetary Fund.','a peace proposal (= a plan to achieve peace ) The Israeli government responded positively to the US peace proposals.','a formal proposal Schools made formal written proposals.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"the government’s proposals for regulation of the industry","translation":"پیشنهادات دولت برای تنظیم صنعت","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001569387.mp3"},{"sentence":"The committee put forward a proposal to reduce the time limit.","translation":"کمیته پیشنهادی برای کاهش محدودیت زمانی ارائه کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000302944.mp3"},{"sentence":"They rejected proposals that the president should be directly elected.","translation":"آنها پیشنهادات مبنی بر اینکه رئیس جمهور باید مستقیما انتخاب شود را رد کردند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001262.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('a0967761-5c21-54c1-ac12-e691045e498c','e2c740a8-4903-545d-981d-7041b7e9d47c',2,null,null,'spoken & written','when you ask someone to marry you',null,null,'وقتی از کسی میخواهی با تو ازدواج کند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['make a proposal I''d like to make a proposal.','put forward/submit a proposal They put forward a proposal for a joint research project.','come up with a proposal (= think of one ) The sales staff came up with an innovative proposal.','draw up a proposal A committee of experts drew up proposals for a constitution.','approve/accept a proposal The proposal was approved by the committee.','support/back a proposal Not one of these organizations supports the government''s proposals.','reject a proposal Councillors had twice rejected proposals for a new village school.','consider a proposal We shall consider their proposals carefully.','discuss a proposal He had discussed the proposal with the Egyptian president.','vote on a proposal Shareholders will vote on the proposal on May 5.','a detailed proposal They drew up a detailed proposal and submitted it to the Department of Energy.','a specific/concrete proposal The report will make specific proposals for further investigation.','a research proposal Applicants should submit a short research proposal on their chosen topic.','a budget/tax proposal (= a budget/tax plan ) Criticism of the budget proposals was voiced by the International Monetary Fund.','a peace proposal (= a plan to achieve peace ) The Israeli government responded positively to the US peace proposals.','a formal proposal Schools made formal written proposals.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"She politely declined his proposal of marriage.","translation":"او مودبانه پیشنهاد ازدواج او را رد کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001569404.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('f09cb4bd-1abf-547e-8ad2-252ba3caa533','a052060f-fb0a-5049-8d64-a26a6332e75d',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a proposed change, plan, development etc is one that has been formally suggested to an official person or group',null,null,'پیشنهادی، مطرح‌شده (رسمی)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The document supplies details of the proposed changes.","translation":"این سند جزئیات تغییرات پیشنهادی را ارائه می دهد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000303639.mp3"},{"sentence":"The government is set to vote on the proposed reforms tomorrow.","translation":"قرار است دولت فردا درباره اصلاحات پیشنهادی رای گیری کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001767024.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('e52d8b64-d499-581f-bce2-9e5006e9b411','285358f9-3ef8-59e4-af43-7c31cb19b27f',1,null,null,'spoken & written','the possibility that something will happen','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'چشم‌انداز، احتمال (رخداد)؛ چشم‌انداز (کار)؛ معادلات (پیشرفت)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"I see no prospect of things improving here.","translation":"من هیچ چشم اندازی برای بهبود اوضاع در اینجا نمی بینم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001591732.mp3"},{"sentence":"There is every prospect (= a strong possibility ) of the weather remaining dry this week.","translation":"هر چشم انداز (= احتمال قوی) از خشک ماندن هوا در این هفته وجود دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001591736.mp3"},{"sentence":"There are good prospects for growth in the retail sector.","translation":"چشم اندازهای خوبی برای رشد در بخش خرده فروشی وجود دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000304117.mp3"},{"sentence":"There’s a real prospect that England will not qualify for the World Cup.","translation":"این احتمال وجود دارد که انگلیس به جام جهانی صعود نکند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001591743.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('e4d63f22-eae1-5aa8-b8d9-c8b8489556d4','285358f9-3ef8-59e4-af43-7c31cb19b27f',2,null,null,'spoken & written','a particular event which will probably or definitely happen in the future – used especially when you want to talk about how you feel about it','[ singular ]',null,'یک رویداد خاص که احتمالاً یا قطعاً در آینده اتفاق می‌افتد - مخصوصاً زمانی استفاده می‌شود که می‌خواهید درباره احساس خود درباره آن صحبت کنید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['daunting (= frightening in a way that makes you not feel confident ) It is a pretty daunting prospect, being on stage for forty minutes.','terrifying Driving through London in a strange car was a terrifying prospect.','gloomy/grim/bleak Many Britons face the grim prospect of having their home repossessed.','exciting We were to be her guardians. This was an exciting prospect.','attractive A journey of that length was not an attractive prospect.','face the prospect (of something) Now they face the prospect of unemployment.','relish the prospect (of something) (= enjoy the thought of it very much ) She would have to speak to him. She didn’t relish the prospect.','dread the prospect (of something) (= feel very worried about it ) I dread the prospect of staying here while you’re away.','be excited/thrilled/delighted etc at the prospect (of something) I was excited at the prospect of going to Washington.','be alarmed/appalled/upset etc at the prospect (of something) She was secretly appalled at the prospect of being looked after by her aunt.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The prospect of marriage terrified Alice.","translation":"احتمال ازدواج آلیس را به وحشت انداخت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001591752.mp3"},{"sentence":"Greeks face the prospect of new general elections next month.","translation":"یونانی ها با چشم انداز انتخابات عمومی جدید در ماه آینده روبرو هستند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001591753.mp3"},{"sentence":"He relishes the prospect of a fight.","translation":"او از چشم انداز دعوا لذت می برد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000304114.mp3"},{"sentence":"She wasn’t exactly overjoyed at the prospect of looking after her niece.","translation":"او دقیقاً از چشم انداز مراقبت از خواهرزاده اش خوشحال نبود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001843236.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('525bfafe-0fb7-50fd-ad86-6b941aa13da9','285358f9-3ef8-59e4-af43-7c31cb19b27f',3,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'prospects','چشم‌انداز، احتمال (رخداد)؛ چشم‌انداز (کار)؛ معادلات (پیشرفت)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('14cd9e3c-16a4-5d70-baa0-d8ed2751e057','285358f9-3ef8-59e4-af43-7c31cb19b27f',4,null,null,'spoken & written','a person, job , plan etc that has a good chance of success in the future','[ countable ]',null,'شخص، شغل، برنامه و غیره که شانس موفقیت خوبی در آینده دارد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('dd92d001-6e43-51c7-80b5-c106afd52a42','285358f9-3ef8-59e4-af43-7c31cb19b27f',5,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'in prospect','چشم‌انداز، احتمال (رخداد)؛ چشم‌انداز (کار)؛ معادلات (پیشرفت)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('eeba3878-ad26-56ba-b65c-579898973660','285358f9-3ef8-59e4-af43-7c31cb19b27f',6,null,null,'formal','a view of a wide area of land , especially from a high place','[ countable usually singular ]',null,'نمایی از یک منطقه وسیع از زمین، به ویژه از یک مکان مرتفع','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('6b36829f-ed69-5560-aee2-a48f4287cfbd','fa79a752-5ed0-5b13-bac5-1aea076e33db',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to examine an area of land or water, in order to find gold , silver , oil etc',null,null,'برای بررسی یک منطقه از زمین یا آب، به منظور یافتن طلا، نقره، نفت و غیره','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The company is prospecting for gold in Alaska.","translation":"این شرکت در حال جستجوی طلا در آلاسکا است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001591773.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('c50d66c7-c060-5207-bab0-74c1875ff5ef','fa79a752-5ed0-5b13-bac5-1aea076e33db',2,null,null,'spoken & written','to look for something, especially business opportunities',null,null,'به دنبال چیزی، به خصوص فرصت های تجاری','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"salesmen prospecting for new customers","translation":"فروشندگان در جستجوی مشتریان جدید","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001591778.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('78dfe9c8-26ff-5708-a03f-5d139b2970a6','5a981091-bb4e-546b-b937-a2939b7725c3',1,null,null,'spoken & written','used to say that something will only be possible if something else happens or is done',null,null,'به شرط اینکه، مشروط به',array['providing']::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"He can come with us, provided he pays for his own meals.","translation":"او می تواند با ما بیاید، مشروط بر اینکه هزینه غذای خود را بپردازد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000305837.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('85481d7b-dbfb-5775-8e8e-445104db21c6','ce914a6c-4fe6-5bbb-b10b-a3c4f08a6a23',1,null,null,'formal','to buy something',null,null,'خرید کردن، خریداری کردن','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"You can purchase insurance online.","translation":"می توانید بیمه را به صورت آنلاین خریداری کنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000278351.mp3"},{"sentence":"the growing demand to purchase goods on credit","translation":"تقاضای فزاینده برای خرید نسیه کالا","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001540119.mp3"},{"sentence":"Where did you purchase the car?","translation":"ماشین رو از کجا خریدی؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001540120.mp3"},{"sentence":"Tickets may be purchased in advance from the box office.","translation":"بلیط ها را می توان از قبل از گیشه خریداری کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001540123.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('cfd59df7-ff42-592b-ac0a-476581f247da','ecf1d768-366e-5a11-8104-13ce2fc869bc',1,null,null,'formal','something you buy, or the act of buying it','[ countable, uncountable ]','hire purchase , purchase price','خرید، خریداری (کالا)؛ خرید (مقدار)؛ خرید (مالی)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"She paid for her purchases and left.","translation":"پول خریدهایش را داد و رفت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001540133.mp3"},{"sentence":"This product should be consumed on the day of purchase.","translation":"این محصول باید در روز خرید مصرف شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001540136.mp3"},{"sentence":"I enclose my receipt as proof of purchase .","translation":"رسیدم را به عنوان مدرک خرید ضمیمه می کنم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001540137.mp3"},{"sentence":"a loan towards the purchase of a new car","translation":"وام برای خرید یک ماشین جدید","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001540143.mp3"},{"sentence":"She made two purchases from my stall.","translation":"او دو خرید از غرفه من انجام داد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001540147.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('dd27b3a9-dde7-58db-9ce3-c3dc453d0a3f','ecf1d768-366e-5a11-8104-13ce2fc869bc',2,null,null,'formal','a firm hold on something','[ singular ]',null,'محکم نگه داشتن چیزی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The ice made it impossible to get a purchase on the road.","translation":"یخبندان امکان خرید در جاده را غیرممکن کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001540158.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('ac99ea38-6c19-5f2c-98f9-faf002415230','53898970-6768-5558-8b3d-9e82668e885e',1,null,null,'spoken & written','an amount of something that can be counted or measured','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'مقدار، کمیت؛ مقدار (زیاد)؛ مقدار (مواد)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a large quantity A large quantity of clothing was stolen from the shop.','a great quantity (= more formal than ‘large’ ) The Romans imported a great quantity of sculpture from Greece.','a vast/huge/enormous quantity Computers can handle vast quantities of data.','a considerable/substantial quantity (= a large or fairly large amount ) Dolphins need to eat considerable quantities of food.','a sufficient quantity (= enough ) How did they obtain sufficient quantities of food to survive?','a small quantity Remove a small quantity of butter from the fridge.','a tiny quantity (= very small ) This truly great wine is only made in tiny quantities.','a minute quantity (= extremely small ) The rock contains minute quantities of copper.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The police also found a quantity of ammunition in the flat.","translation":"پلیس همچنین مقداری مهمات در این آپارتمان کشف کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001769710.mp3"},{"sentence":"Add 50 grams of butter, and the same quantity of sugar.","translation":"50 گرم کره و به همان مقدار شکر اضافه کنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001769711.mp3"},{"sentence":"He had consumed a large quantity of alcohol.","translation":"او مقدار زیادی الکل مصرف کرده بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001769712.mp3"},{"sentence":"Huge quantities of oil were spilling into the sea.","translation":"مقادیر زیادی نفت به دریا می ریخت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001561976.mp3"},{"sentence":"Buy vegetables in small quantities, for your immediate use.","translation":"سبزیجات را در مقادیر کم، برای استفاده فوری خود بخرید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001561979.mp3"},{"sentence":"Your work has improved in quantity and quality this term.","translation":"کار شما در این مدت از نظر کمی و کیفی بهبود یافته است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001561981.mp3"}]'::jsonb,6),
('83a353e0-0dde-59cc-b7f1-e442a3012d21','53898970-6768-5558-8b3d-9e82668e885e',2,null,null,'spoken & written','the large amount of something','[ uncountable ]',null,'مقدار زیاد چیزی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a large quantity A large quantity of clothing was stolen from the shop.','a great quantity (= more formal than ‘large’ ) The Romans imported a great quantity of sculpture from Greece.','a vast/huge/enormous quantity Computers can handle vast quantities of data.','a considerable/substantial quantity (= a large or fairly large amount ) Dolphins need to eat considerable quantities of food.','a sufficient quantity (= enough ) How did they obtain sufficient quantities of food to survive?','a small quantity Remove a small quantity of butter from the fridge.','a tiny quantity (= very small ) This truly great wine is only made in tiny quantities.','a minute quantity (= extremely small ) The rock contains minute quantities of copper.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The sheer quantity of text meant that people did not read the whole of their newspaper.","translation":"حجم زیاد متن به این معنی بود که مردم کل روزنامه خود را نمی خوانند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001769713.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('86fa0b6e-c6be-506a-99ac-811afec7ba53','53898970-6768-5558-8b3d-9e82668e885e',3,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'in quantity','مقدار، کمیت؛ مقدار (زیاد)؛ مقدار (مواد)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a large quantity A large quantity of clothing was stolen from the shop.','a great quantity (= more formal than ‘large’ ) The Romans imported a great quantity of sculpture from Greece.','a vast/huge/enormous quantity Computers can handle vast quantities of data.','a considerable/substantial quantity (= a large or fairly large amount ) Dolphins need to eat considerable quantities of food.','a sufficient quantity (= enough ) How did they obtain sufficient quantities of food to survive?','a small quantity Remove a small quantity of butter from the fridge.','a tiny quantity (= very small ) This truly great wine is only made in tiny quantities.','a minute quantity (= extremely small ) The rock contains minute quantities of copper.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('a2d14f28-83d1-5e35-907d-8ba1d7cc6946','045ef972-9ced-59e4-b5aa-e3fad3eda74d',1,'asking for information','درخواست اطلاعات','spoken & written','a sentence or phrase that is used to ask for information or to test someone’s knowledge','[ countable ]',null,'پرسش، سؤال؛ مسئله (بحث)؛ بحث (پیش آمده)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['ask (somebody) a question Don’t be afraid to ask questions.','have a question (= want to ask a question ) I just have one question: is the treatment effective?','pose a question formal (= ask a question ) He poses the question, ‘What should we teach our children?’','put a question to somebody (= ask a question in a formal situation ) I recently put some of these questions to a psychologist.','answer a question You haven’t answered my question.','avoid/evade/dodge a question (= not give a direct answer ) He had skilfully evaded Margie’s questions.','set a question (= invent a question for a test ) He used to set the questions for a TV quiz show.','rephrase a question (= ask it in a different way ) He didn’t answer, so I rephrased my question.','bombard somebody with questions (= ask someone a lot of questions ) They bombarded him with questions about the case.','field questions (= answer a lot of questions ) He fielded questions from reporters about the announcement.','difficult/hard Some of the questions in the last section were very difficult.','easy These questions should be easy for you.','a good question (= interesting or difficult to answer ) That’s a good question.','a stupid/silly question (= one whose answer is obvious ) Did you win, or is that a stupid question?','an awkward question (= one that someone does not want to answer ) How can we keep the press from asking awkward questions?','a tricky/tough question (= one that is difficult to answer ) That’s a really tricky question.','an embarrassing question The media began to ask embarrassing questions about MPs'' expenses.','a personal question (= one relating to someone’s private life ) Can I ask you a personal question?','a simple question (= one that is easy to answer ) All you have to do is answer the three simple questions below.','a searching/probing question (= one designed to find things out ) The immigration officer asked me some searching questions.','a direct question (= one that asks for information in a very direct way ) She was startled by the direct question.','an exam/a test question You have to answer twenty exam questions.','an impertinent question (= one which you have no right to ask ) She did not answer the maid’s impertinent question.','a rhetorical question (= one that you ask without expecting an answer, in order to make a point )','a multiple choice question (= where you are given a set of possible answers )']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Can I ask you a question?","translation":"میتونم یه سوال بپرسم؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001769786.mp3"},{"sentence":"I’m afraid I can’t answer that question.","translation":"می ترسم نتوانم به این سوال پاسخ دهم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001769792.mp3"},{"sentence":"They asked me quite a lot of difficult questions about my job.","translation":"آنها از من سؤالات دشوار زیادی در مورد شغلم پرسیدند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001769798.mp3"},{"sentence":"The survey included questions on age and smoking habits.","translation":"این نظرسنجی شامل سوالاتی در مورد سن و عادات سیگار کشیدن بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001562218.mp3"},{"sentence":"In answer to your last question, ‘Yes’.","translation":"در پاسخ به آخرین سوال شما، \"بله\".","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001562225.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('0782d146-00d0-572e-a684-ddb2c79bb91c','045ef972-9ced-59e4-b5aa-e3fad3eda74d',2,'subject/problem','موضوع/مشکل','spoken & written','a subject or problem that needs to be discussed or dealt with','[ countable ]',null,'موضوع یا مشکلی که نیاز به بحث و بررسی دارد',array['issue']::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"We discussed the question of confidentiality.","translation":"ما در مورد مسئله محرمانه بودن بحث کردیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001769801.mp3"},{"sentence":"This raises the question of government funding.","translation":"این مسئله بودجه دولت را مطرح می کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001562242.mp3"},{"sentence":"an urgent need to address the question of crime","translation":"نیاز فوری برای پرداختن به مسئله جرم","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000466831.mp3"},{"sentence":"Several questions have still not been resolved .","translation":"چندین سوال هنوز حل نشده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000466830.mp3"},{"sentence":"The question is should I take the job in Japan, or should I stay here?","translation":"سوال این است که آیا باید در ژاپن کار کنم یا اینجا بمانم؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001562254.mp3"},{"sentence":"Some important questions remain unanswered (= still have not been dealt with or explained ) .","translation":"برخی از سوالات مهم بی پاسخ می مانند (= هنوز به آنها پرداخته نشده یا توضیح داده نشده است).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001975280.mp3"}]'::jsonb,6),
('839456f8-4957-52cd-81ee-07a4edaabe2e','045ef972-9ced-59e4-b5aa-e3fad3eda74d',3,'doubt','شک','spoken & written','if there is some question about something, there is doubt about it, or people feel uncertain about it','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'اگر سؤالی در مورد چیزی وجود دارد، در مورد آن شک وجود دارد یا مردم در مورد آن احساس عدم اطمینان می کنند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The exact cause of death is still open to question (= not certain ) .","translation":"علت دقیق مرگ هنوز جای سوال دارد (= مطمئن نیست).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001769802.mp3"},{"sentence":"This has called into question people’s right to retire at 60.","translation":"این موضوع حق بازنشستگی افراد در 60 سالگی را زیر سوال برده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001562277.mp3"},{"sentence":"He’s by far the best candidate, there’s no question about it (= it is completely certain ) .","translation":"او تا حد زیادی بهترین نامزد است، هیچ سوالی در مورد آن وجود ندارد (= کاملاً مطمئن است).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001769807.mp3"},{"sentence":"There is no question that (= it is completely certain that ) the government knew about the deal.","translation":"این که (= کاملاً مسلم است که) دولت از این معامله اطلاع داشته است، تردیدی نیست.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001769813.mp3"},{"sentence":"Her efficiency and intelligence are beyond question.","translation":"کارایی و هوش او قابل بحث نیست.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001562279.mp3"},{"sentence":"There are questions about the system’s practicality.","translation":"سوالاتی در مورد عملی بودن سیستم وجود دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001276.mp3"}]'::jsonb,6),
