('91364963-f495-5d1e-8973-906cd30e4ba4','c4e706ab-d1e6-5a54-84e4-5170a733af90',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to ask someone questions in order to get information about something such as a crime',null,null,'بازخواست کردن؛ تردید کردن (در)؛ بازپرسی (فرد)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Two men have been arrested and questioned.","translation":"دو مرد دستگیر و بازجویی شده اند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000466932.mp3"},{"sentence":"She hates being questioned about her past.","translation":"او از اینکه در مورد گذشته اش سوال شود متنفر است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001562293.mp3"},{"sentence":"Joseph questioned the doctors closely (= asked them a lot of questions ) .","translation":"يوسف پزشكان را از نزديك سؤال كرد (= از آنها سؤالات زيادي كرد).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001769819.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('2502cb6b-1073-5b7e-8f77-1cb472a7e5f5','c4e706ab-d1e6-5a54-84e4-5170a733af90',2,null,null,'spoken & written','to have or express doubts about whether something is true, good, necessary etc',null,null,'داشتن یا ابراز تردید در مورد درست، خوب، ضروری بودن چیزی و غیره','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Are you questioning what I’m saying?","translation":"آیا از آنچه من می گویم سؤال می کنید؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000466942.mp3"},{"sentence":"No one dared to question his decisions.","translation":"هیچ کس جرات نداشت تصمیمات او را زیر سوال ببرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000466943.mp3"},{"sentence":"One questions whether he’s telling the truth.","translation":"یکی سوال می کند که آیا او راست می گوید؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001823680.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('f17a61b6-5e9c-5bd1-a8c2-b7d573ff038e','a92618cb-bdef-5d72-bc09-d5a921e48f4a',1,'to a situation/event','به یک موقعیت/رویداد','spoken & written','something that you feel or do because of something that has happened or been said','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'واکنش، برخورد؛ واکنش (شیمیایی)؛ واکنش (روانی)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['somebody’s first/initial/immediate reaction His first reaction was to laugh.','somebody’s gut reaction informal (= what they feel or decide immediately, before thinking ) You must trust your gut reactions.','somebody’s instinctive reaction (= what they do immediately, before thinking ) Often your instinctive reaction is to blame someone else.','a natural reaction Anger is a natural reaction if you feel undervalued.','a knee-jerk reaction (= an immediate reaction that happens without sensible thinking ) Environmentalists have a knee-jerk reaction against any development.','an emotional reaction (= showing strong emotion, especially by crying ) I was surprised by her emotional reaction to the news.','a positive/favourable reaction (= showing that someone agrees or likes something ) There has been a positive reaction to the campaign.','a negative reaction (= showing that someone disagrees or dislikes something ) We are concerned about the negative reaction of some of our customers.','mixed reactions (= some positive and some negative reactions ) The book met with mixed reactions.','a violent/angry reaction The artists were surprised by the violent reactions to their work.','a delayed reaction (= a reaction that comes some time after an event ) You’re suffering a delayed reaction to the accident.','the public reaction (= what the public think about something that happens ) The public reaction was less than encouraging.','provoke/produce/bring a reaction The decision provoked an angry reaction from the local tourist industry.','get a reaction We didn’t know what kind of reaction we would get.','gauge somebody’s reaction (= judge or find out someone’s reaction ) He watched Jane’s face, trying to gauge her reaction.','judging by somebody’s reactions Judging by the audience’s reactions, the show will be a great success.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"What was Jeff’s reaction when you told him about the job?","translation":"واکنش جف وقتی در مورد این کار به او گفتید چه بود؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000480485.mp3"},{"sentence":"the government’s reaction to the fuel crisis","translation":"واکنش دولت به بحران سوخت","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000480488.mp3"},{"sentence":"An emergency fund was set up in reaction to the famine.","translation":"یک صندوق اضطراری در واکنش به قحطی ایجاد شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001604208.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('4d707a48-03e1-5200-92cf-39eb36e9f7cf','a92618cb-bdef-5d72-bc09-d5a921e48f4a',2,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'reactions','واکنش، برخورد؛ واکنش (شیمیایی)؛ واکنش (روانی)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('0406dc52-eec2-536c-b35b-8c5aaf411e38','a92618cb-bdef-5d72-bc09-d5a921e48f4a',3,'to food/drugs','به غذا/داروها','spoken & written','if you have a reaction to a drug or to something you have eaten, it makes you ill','[ countable ]',null,'اگر به یک دارو یا چیزی که خورده اید واکنش نشان دهید، شما را بیمار می کند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"a reaction to the immunization","translation":"واکنش به ایمن سازی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000480515.mp3"},{"sentence":"She had a severe allergic reaction to the drug.","translation":"او واکنش آلرژیک شدید به دارو داشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001604213.mp3"},{"sentence":"Certain foods are more likely than others to cause allergic reactions .","translation":"برخی از غذاها بیشتر از سایرین باعث ایجاد واکنش های آلرژیک می شوند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001604219.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('80b1fb02-2f8b-5330-9f2e-2792a6b5f2a6','a92618cb-bdef-5d72-bc09-d5a921e48f4a',4,'science','علم','spoken & written','a chemical change that happens when two or more substances are mixed together','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'یک تغییر شیمیایی که زمانی اتفاق می افتد که دو یا چند ماده با هم مخلوط شوند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"a chemical reaction in the soil","translation":"یک واکنش شیمیایی در خاک","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001604220.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('09020f61-a499-58ef-8d96-1f039f05687f','a92618cb-bdef-5d72-bc09-d5a921e48f4a',5,'change','تغییر دهید','spoken & written','a change in people’s attitudes , behaviour , fashions etc that happens because they disapprove of the way in which things were done in the past','[ singular ]',null,'تغییر در نگرش، رفتار، مد و غیره افراد که به این دلیل اتفاق می‌افتد که روش انجام کارها در گذشته را تایید نمی‌کنند.','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"a reaction against the traditional values of the nineteenth century","translation":"واکنشی در برابر ارزش های سنتی قرن نوزدهم","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000480537.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('5fe551ab-1ddb-56d8-ae67-25fb6065bc31','a92618cb-bdef-5d72-bc09-d5a921e48f4a',6,'against change','در برابر تغییر','formal','strong and unreasonable opposition to all social and political changes','[ uncountable ]',null,'مخالفت شدید و غیرمنطقی با همه تغییرات اجتماعی و سیاسی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The revolutionary movement was crushed by the forces of reaction .","translation":"جنبش انقلابی توسط نیروهای ارتجاع در هم شکست.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000480551.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('42006b10-a95f-54f0-8ebe-18556b24515c','6203faad-6cd7-581c-bef9-4a844c5e7896',1,null,null,'spoken & written','not long ago',null,null,'اخیراً، به‌تازگی؛ جدیداً','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"He has recently been promoted to Assistant Manager.","translation":"او اخیراً به سمت دستیار مدیر ارتقا یافته است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001299.mp3"},{"sentence":"a recently published biography","translation":"بیوگرافی اخیرا منتشر شده","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001770562.mp3"},{"sentence":"Jerry lived in Cairo until quite recently .","translation":"جری تا همین اواخر در قاهره زندگی می کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000760294.mp3"},{"sentence":"More recently , he’s appeared in a number of British films.","translation":"اخیراً او در تعدادی از فیلم های بریتانیایی ظاهر شده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001604950.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('5e550bf4-02ef-5baf-ac8e-20ae47e40781','ba44975e-140e-5914-a0a5-6262ecc725b3',1,null,null,'spoken & written','the process of getting better after an illness , injury etc','[ singular, uncountable ]',null,'بهبودی، رجعت (بازیابی)؛ بازیابی (داده)؛ بهبود (اقتصاد)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['make a recovery She has since made a complete recovery.','speed (up) somebody’s recovery (= make them recover more quickly ) She believes that a holiday would speed my recovery.','aid somebody’s recovery (= help someone to recover ) Although it is not a cure, the drug can aid recovery.','a full/complete recovery She was severely injured but made a full recovery.','a good/satisfactory recovery He is making a good recovery from a knee injury.','a remarkable/amazing/miraculous recovery Doctors have every confidence that Laura will continue her remarkable recovery.','a speedy/quick/swift recovery We wish him a speedy recovery.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Doctors expect him to make a full recovery.","translation":"پزشکان انتظار دارند که او بهبودی کامل پیدا کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001771444.mp3"},{"sentence":"Ann made a quick recovery from her operation.","translation":"ان پس از عمل جراحی خود به سرعت بهبود یافت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000761784.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('985c40e0-d643-54ca-a89f-3960df77669b','ba44975e-140e-5914-a0a5-6262ecc725b3',2,null,null,'spoken & written','the process of returning to a normal condition after a period of trouble or difficulty','[ singular, uncountable ]',null,'فرآیند بازگشت به شرایط عادی پس از یک دوره مشکل یا دشواری','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Hopes of economic recovery are fading.","translation":"امید به بهبود اقتصادی در حال محو شدن است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000761789.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
