('f2a53f95-20ea-5632-a033-e4c15baa911d','88a073e2-e343-5824-9046-53269ef0502f',1,'the past','گذشته','spoken & written','to have a picture or idea in your mind of people, events , places etc from the past','[ intransitive, transitive ]',null,'به یاد آوردن، به یاد داشتن؛ یادبود گرفتن (فرد)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['remember well (= thoroughly and completely ) I remember so well my first day there.','remember clearly/vividly/distinctly (= well, with a lot of detail ) I remember clearly how I used to feel as a child in church on Sundays.','remember vaguely/dimly (= not well ) He could vaguely remember his mother’s face.','remember fondly (= in a way that shows you liked someone or something a lot ) The restaurant is fondly remembered by many.','remember rightly/correctly You were still at school, if I remember rightly.','hardly/barely remember (= almost not at all ) I can hardly remember him.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Do you remember Rosa Davies?","translation":"رزا دیویس را به خاطر دارید؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000773039.mp3"},{"sentence":"I can’t remember her exact words.","translation":"کلمات دقیق او را به خاطر نمی آورم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001570125.mp3"},{"sentence":"I remember you two couldn’t stand each other at first!","translation":"یادم هست شما دو نفر اول نتوانستید همدیگر را تحمل کنید!","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000773043.mp3"},{"sentence":"I remember meeting her at a party once.","translation":"یادم می آید یک بار در یک مهمانی با او ملاقات کردم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000773052.mp3"},{"sentence":"I remember my father bringing home a huge Christmas tree.","translation":"یادم می آید که پدرم درخت کریسمس بزرگی را به خانه آورد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000773046.mp3"},{"sentence":"I remember it well ; I’d never seen my mother so angry.","translation":"من آن را خوب به یاد دارم؛ هرگز مادرم را اینقدر عصبانی ندیده بودم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000773055.mp3"},{"sentence":"She clearly remembers the excitement as they boarded the train.","translation":"او به وضوح هیجانی را که سوار قطار می شدند به یاد می آورد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000773065.mp3"},{"sentence":"I vaguely remember reading something about it in the paper.","translation":"به طور مبهم به یاد دارم که چیزی در مورد آن در روزنامه خوانده بودم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000773059.mp3"},{"sentence":"They had three children, if I remember rightly .","translation":"اگر درست یادم باشد آنها سه فرزند داشتند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000773062.mp3"},{"sentence":"They’ve lived here for as long as I can remember .","translation":"آنها از زمانی که من به یاد دارم اینجا زندگی می کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001971571.mp3"},{"sentence":"No one got drunk as far as I can remember .","translation":"تا جایی که یادم میاد هیچکس مست نشد .","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001971575.mp3"},{"sentence":"Yes, I remember him.","translation":"بله، او را به یاد دارم.","audio_url":null},{"sentence":"Yes, I can remember him.","translation":"بله، می توانم او را به یاد بیاورم.","audio_url":null},{"sentence":"Do you remember that day?","translation":"اون روز رو یادت هست؟","audio_url":null}]'::jsonb,14),
('cb6ac258-0379-593b-84b8-03f48ed0fd03','88a073e2-e343-5824-9046-53269ef0502f',2,'information/facts','اطلاعات/حقایق','spoken & written','to bring information or facts that you know into your mind','[ intransitive, transitive ]',null,'تا اطلاعات یا حقایقی را که می دانید در ذهن خود بیاورید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['remember well (= thoroughly and completely ) I remember so well my first day there.','remember clearly/vividly/distinctly (= well, with a lot of detail ) I remember clearly how I used to feel as a child in church on Sundays.','remember vaguely/dimly (= not well ) He could vaguely remember his mother’s face.','remember fondly (= in a way that shows you liked someone or something a lot ) The restaurant is fondly remembered by many.','remember rightly/correctly You were still at school, if I remember rightly.','hardly/barely remember (= almost not at all ) I can hardly remember him.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"You left your keys on the table, remember?","translation":"کلیدهایت را روی میز گذاشتی، یادت هست؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000773071.mp3"},{"sentence":"I can’t remember her phone number.","translation":"شماره تلفن او را به خاطر نمی آورم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000773072.mp3"},{"sentence":"I suddenly remembered that I’d left the stove on.","translation":"ناگهان به یاد آوردم که اجاق گاز را روشن گذاشته ام.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000773075.mp3"},{"sentence":"I called the office, but I don’t remember who I spoke to.","translation":"با دفتر تماس گرفتم، اما یادم نیست با چه کسی صحبت کردم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000773078.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('5c469a53-3cae-56f6-90ef-56f219fdc7b5','88a073e2-e343-5824-9046-53269ef0502f',3,'to do/get something','کاری کردن/به دست آوردن','spoken & written','to not forget something that you must do, get, or bring','[ intransitive, transitive ]',null,'تا کاری را که باید انجام دهید، بدست آورید یا بیاورید را فراموش نکنید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['remember well (= thoroughly and completely ) I remember so well my first day there.','remember clearly/vividly/distinctly (= well, with a lot of detail ) I remember clearly how I used to feel as a child in church on Sundays.','remember vaguely/dimly (= not well ) He could vaguely remember his mother’s face.','remember fondly (= in a way that shows you liked someone or something a lot ) The restaurant is fondly remembered by many.','remember rightly/correctly You were still at school, if I remember rightly.','hardly/barely remember (= almost not at all ) I can hardly remember him.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"I hope he remembers the wine.","translation":"امیدوارم شراب را به خاطر بیاورد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000773090.mp3"},{"sentence":"Remember to take your P.E. clothes to school.","translation":"به یاد داشته باشید که P.E خود را مصرف کنید. لباس به مدرسه","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000773087.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('36bcccbd-8af6-5897-a7b5-9997bba86534','88a073e2-e343-5824-9046-53269ef0502f',4,'keep something in mind','چیزی را در نظر داشته باشید','spoken & written','to keep a particular fact about a situation in your mind','[ transitive ]',null,'تا یک واقعیت خاص در مورد یک موقعیت را در ذهن خود نگه دارید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['remember well (= thoroughly and completely ) I remember so well my first day there.','remember clearly/vividly/distinctly (= well, with a lot of detail ) I remember clearly how I used to feel as a child in church on Sundays.','remember vaguely/dimly (= not well ) He could vaguely remember his mother’s face.','remember fondly (= in a way that shows you liked someone or something a lot ) The restaurant is fondly remembered by many.','remember rightly/correctly You were still at school, if I remember rightly.','hardly/barely remember (= almost not at all ) I can hardly remember him.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Remember, processed food is usually full of salt and sugar.","translation":"به یاد داشته باشید، غذاهای فرآوری شده معمولا پر از نمک و شکر هستند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001570148.mp3"},{"sentence":"Remember that not everyone has as much money as you.","translation":"به یاد داشته باشید که همه به اندازه شما پول ندارند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000773098.mp3"},{"sentence":"It should be remembered that a lot of work went into this event.","translation":"لازم به ذکر است که برای این رویداد کار زیادی انجام شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001570151.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('dc9adc7a-4ae3-5667-a335-6c5218de76c0','88a073e2-e343-5824-9046-53269ef0502f',5,'honour the dead','مردگان را گرامی بدار','spoken & written','to think with respect about someone who has died , often in a ceremony','[ transitive ]',null,'فکر کردن با احترام در مورد کسی که مرده است، اغلب در یک مراسم','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['remember well (= thoroughly and completely ) I remember so well my first day there.','remember clearly/vividly/distinctly (= well, with a lot of detail ) I remember clearly how I used to feel as a child in church on Sundays.','remember vaguely/dimly (= not well ) He could vaguely remember his mother’s face.','remember fondly (= in a way that shows you liked someone or something a lot ) The restaurant is fondly remembered by many.','remember rightly/correctly You were still at school, if I remember rightly.','hardly/barely remember (= almost not at all ) I can hardly remember him.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"On this day we remember the dead of two world wars.","translation":"در این روز از کشته شدگان دو جنگ جهانی یاد می کنیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000773103.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('79656944-cc7e-5b87-a928-9e5de7fb3bf9','88a073e2-e343-5824-9046-53269ef0502f',6,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'be remembered for/as something','به یاد آوردن، به یاد داشتن؛ یادبود گرفتن (فرد)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['remember well (= thoroughly and completely ) I remember so well my first day there.','remember clearly/vividly/distinctly (= well, with a lot of detail ) I remember clearly how I used to feel as a child in church on Sundays.','remember vaguely/dimly (= not well ) He could vaguely remember his mother’s face.','remember fondly (= in a way that shows you liked someone or something a lot ) The restaurant is fondly remembered by many.','remember rightly/correctly You were still at school, if I remember rightly.','hardly/barely remember (= almost not at all ) I can hardly remember him.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('9df69fea-eabb-5b8d-b48b-46a46e1822da','88a073e2-e343-5824-9046-53269ef0502f',7,'give somebody a present','به کسی هدیه بده','spoken & written','to give someone a present on a particular occasion','[ transitive ]',null,'هدیه دادن به کسی در یک مناسبت خاص','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['remember well (= thoroughly and completely ) I remember so well my first day there.','remember clearly/vividly/distinctly (= well, with a lot of detail ) I remember clearly how I used to feel as a child in church on Sundays.','remember vaguely/dimly (= not well ) He could vaguely remember his mother’s face.','remember fondly (= in a way that shows you liked someone or something a lot ) The restaurant is fondly remembered by many.','remember rightly/correctly You were still at school, if I remember rightly.','hardly/barely remember (= almost not at all ) I can hardly remember him.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Lilian always remembers me at Christmas.","translation":"لیلیان همیشه در کریسمس به یاد من است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000773114.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('ba19f279-1658-575f-bb8b-9d654b6be539','88a073e2-e343-5824-9046-53269ef0502f',8,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'remember me to somebody','به یاد آوردن، به یاد داشتن؛ یادبود گرفتن (فرد)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['remember well (= thoroughly and completely ) I remember so well my first day there.','remember clearly/vividly/distinctly (= well, with a lot of detail ) I remember clearly how I used to feel as a child in church on Sundays.','remember vaguely/dimly (= not well ) He could vaguely remember his mother’s face.','remember fondly (= in a way that shows you liked someone or something a lot ) The restaurant is fondly remembered by many.','remember rightly/correctly You were still at school, if I remember rightly.','hardly/barely remember (= almost not at all ) I can hardly remember him.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('35c4f948-0673-5139-942f-17efeb1fc459','e3d46a2d-8263-582b-8e14-46c18528a586',1,null,null,'spoken & written','someone whose job is to write about news events for a newspaper , or to tell people about them on television or on the radio',null,null,'خبرنگار، گزارشگر؛ خبرنگار (رادیو)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a newspaper reporter The case attracted newspaper reporters from all over the world.','a television/radio reporter He told television reporters that he had no plans to resign.','a news/crime/sports reporter He started as a news reporter on Radio 1.','a political reporter Pinchetti became the magazine''s top political reporter.','an investigative reporter (= one that tries to find out about something important ) Two investigative reporters wrote an article linking the CIA to cocaine trafficking in Los Angeles.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"a news reporter","translation":"یک خبرنگار خبری","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001770937.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('0ea4a524-687e-5990-aec0-ee2d1faeb0ee','28112ba3-2f25-5cf7-b4fa-5e5b9604807d',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a country governed by elected representatives of the people, and led by a president , not a king or queen',null,null,'جمهوری، حکومت جمهوری','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"the former Federal Republic of Germany","translation":"جمهوری فدرال سابق آلمان","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001770964.mp3"},{"sentence":"Nine republics took part in the referendum.","translation":"9 جمهوری در همه پرسی شرکت کردند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001770965.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('f634cf40-6417-5b2a-aa29-dc2db9730347','d54c13e3-6f37-51c6-8b47-68f51640e30a',1,null,null,'spoken & written','serious study of a subject , in order to discover new facts or test new ideas',null,null,'تحقیق، پژوهش؛ تحقیق (علمی)؛ تحقیق (بازار)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['do/carry out research ( also conduct research formal ) The research was carried out by a team of scientists at Edinburgh University. Little research has been conducted into the subject.','undertake research formal (= start or do research ) They are planning to undertake research into the genetic causes of the disease.','scientific research Our conclusions are based on scientific research.','medical research The charity raises money for medical research.','historical research This is a fascinating piece of historical research.','basic research (= the most important or most necessary area of research ) He wants to conduct basic research into the nature of human cells.','extensive research (= research that examines a lot of information and details ) Extensive research has proved the theory wrong.','painstaking research (= very careful and thorough research ) She spent years carrying out painstaking historical research.','pioneering research (= research that produces completely new information ) Watson did pioneering research on the long-term effects of dieting.','a research project/programme The research project will be funded by the Medical Research Council.','research findings (= what is discovered by a piece of research ) He will present his research findings at the conference.','research work Doctor Fox received world-wide acclaim for her research work on breast cancer.','a research team The professor will head a research team working on the effects of climatic change on agriculture.','a research student He supervised many research students.','a research grant (= money for doing research ) Have you applied for a research grant?','an area/field of research This is a very exciting area of research.','a piece of research A recent piece of research shows why marriages break up.','a body of research (= results from several pieces of research ) There is a large body of research which indicates that passive smoking causes cancer.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"research into the causes of cancer","translation":"تحقیق در مورد علل سرطان","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000744122.mp3"},{"sentence":"Gould was helped in his researches by local naturalists.","translation":"گولد در تحقیقات خود توسط طبیعت گرایان محلی یاری شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001770914.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('0019c358-ecab-5f92-869b-c7076fa4020c','d54c13e3-6f37-51c6-8b47-68f51640e30a',2,null,null,'spoken & written','the activity of finding information about something that you are interested in or need to know about',null,null,'فعالیت یافتن اطلاعات در مورد چیزی که به آن علاقه دارید یا باید در مورد آن بدانید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['do/carry out research ( also conduct research formal ) The research was carried out by a team of scientists at Edinburgh University. Little research has been conducted into the subject.','undertake research formal (= start or do research ) They are planning to undertake research into the genetic causes of the disease.','scientific research Our conclusions are based on scientific research.','medical research The charity raises money for medical research.','historical research This is a fascinating piece of historical research.','basic research (= the most important or most necessary area of research ) He wants to conduct basic research into the nature of human cells.','extensive research (= research that examines a lot of information and details ) Extensive research has proved the theory wrong.','painstaking research (= very careful and thorough research ) She spent years carrying out painstaking historical research.','pioneering research (= research that produces completely new information ) Watson did pioneering research on the long-term effects of dieting.','a research project/programme The research project will be funded by the Medical Research Council.','research findings (= what is discovered by a piece of research ) He will present his research findings at the conference.','research work Doctor Fox received world-wide acclaim for her research work on breast cancer.','a research team The professor will head a research team working on the effects of climatic change on agriculture.','a research student He supervised many research students.','a research grant (= money for doing research ) Have you applied for a research grant?','an area/field of research This is a very exciting area of research.','a piece of research A recent piece of research shows why marriages break up.','a body of research (= results from several pieces of research ) There is a large body of research which indicates that passive smoking causes cancer.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"It’s a good idea to do some research before you buy a house.","translation":"این ایده خوبی است که قبل از خرید خانه کمی تحقیق کنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001607536.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('d3b2bd80-5e0a-5446-88de-34a5d11d7858','1c62de92-6eda-5ce3-8b31-d76e2ce3316a',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to study a subject in detail, especially in order to discover new facts or test new ideas',null,null,'مطالعه یک موضوع با جزئیات، به ویژه به منظور کشف حقایق جدید یا آزمایش ایده های جدید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"He’s been researching material for a documentary.","translation":"او در حال تحقیق در مورد مواد برای یک مستند است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001770915.mp3"},{"sentence":"Ten years ago I began researching into the role of women in trade unions.","translation":"ده سال پیش شروع به تحقیق در مورد نقش زنان در اتحادیه های کارگری کردم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001607547.mp3"},{"sentence":"She’s been doing some research into the history of the area.","translation":"او در حال انجام برخی تحقیقات در مورد تاریخ این منطقه است.","audio_url":null}]'::jsonb,3),
('af9ee699-565b-58fb-9409-4e8b1085d19e','1c62de92-6eda-5ce3-8b31-d76e2ce3316a',2,null,null,'spoken & written','to get all the necessary facts and information for something',null,null,'برای به دست آوردن تمام حقایق و اطلاعات لازم برای چیزی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"This book has been very well researched.","translation":"این کتاب بسیار خوب تحقیق شده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000744156.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('e9c63272-4b9f-55a7-b06a-359f54d3d42f','9863ba8f-a56a-54f4-aa51-f5708df14562',1,null,null,'spoken & written','someone who lives or stays in a particular place',null,null,'ساکن، بومی؛ مقیم (محل)؛ ساکن (کشور)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"the residents of Westville","translation":"ساکنان وست ویل","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000744718.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('ea951570-69f2-5624-8e91-c49dc38df689','9863ba8f-a56a-54f4-aa51-f5708df14562',2,null,null,'spoken & written','a doctor working at a hospital where he or she is being trained',null,null,'دکتری که در بیمارستانی کار می کند که در آن در حال آموزش است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('131b021f-5ebc-5f36-bbd8-e6dbcd8f30d8','a4af9263-c436-5d69-ab90-065f755b01d4',1,null,null,'formal','living in a place',null,null,'زندگی در یک مکان','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Many retired British people are now resident in Spain.","translation":"بسیاری از بریتانیایی های بازنشسته اکنون در اسپانیا ساکن هستند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000744695.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('1b922fa5-b1b4-562c-86fb-91e3642109ad','a4af9263-c436-5d69-ab90-065f755b01d4',2,null,null,'spoken & written','living or working in a particular place or institution','[ only before noun ]',null,'زندگی یا کار در یک مکان یا موسسه خاص','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"a resident tutor","translation":"یک معلم خصوصی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000744700.mp3"},{"sentence":"The resident population of mental hospitals has fallen by 20%.","translation":"جمعیت ساکن بیمارستان های روانی 20 درصد کاهش یافته است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001877145.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('eab52eca-0cb0-516c-9aa0-6d6d685e2f41','a4af9263-c436-5d69-ab90-065f755b01d4',3,null,null,'spoken & written','belonging to a particular group of people – used humorously','[ only before noun ]',null,'متعلق به گروه خاصی از مردم - به صورت طنز استفاده می شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"He’s our resident expert on computer games.","translation":"او متخصص مقیم ما در بازی های رایانه ای است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000744706.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('7b67bf09-2ddb-5e7d-b9c7-08b46b0ba2cf','bf800ae2-96a9-51de-a764-5f30c57e29bc',1,'land/oil/coal etc','زمین / نفت / زغال سنگ و غیره','spoken & written','something such as useful land, or minerals such as oil or coal , that exists in a country and can be used to increase its wealth','[ countable usually plural ]',null,'منابع، منابع (طبیعی)؛ منابع (مالی)؛ منابع (انرژی)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['natural resources We support the sustainable use of natural resources.','mineral resources This area is rich in mineral resources.','energy resources The country has few energy resources of its own.','water resources Botswana expressed growing concern over its dwindling water resources.','oil resources oil resources in the North Sea','a renewable resource (= one that replaces itself naturally, or is easily replaced ) Trees are a renewable resource.','a non-renewable resource We should reduce our use of non-renewable resources.','a finite resource (= one which is limited in amount, so that it will no longer exist if people continue to use it ) Crude oil is a finite resource.','a national resource High-quality agricultural land is a national resource.','use resources Modern products use fewer natural resources.','exploit resources He exploited the mineral resources which he found under his lands.','tap resources (= take them from an area ) Several nations are eager to tap the mineral resources in Antarctica.','be rich in resources Swaziland is rich in natural resources.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Canada’s vast mineral resources","translation":"منابع معدنی وسیع کانادا","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000745483.mp3"},{"sentence":"a country rich in natural resources","translation":"کشوری سرشار از منابع طبیعی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000745486.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('276f1426-16b2-534f-b818-5827d766f4ed','bf800ae2-96a9-51de-a764-5f30c57e29bc',2,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'resources','منابع، منابع (طبیعی)؛ منابع (مالی)؛ منابع (انرژی)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
