ch of security at the prison last Friday.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Parenting is about giving your child security and love.","translation":"فرزندپروری یعنی دادن امنیت و عشق به فرزندتان.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001564750.mp3"},{"sentence":"Workers want greater job security (= not being in danger of losing their jobs ) .","translation":"کارگران خواهان امنیت شغلی بیشتر هستند (= در خطر از دست دادن شغل خود نباشند).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001564751.mp3"},{"sentence":"This insurance plan offers your family financial security in the event of your death.","translation":"این طرح بیمه امنیت مالی خانواده شما را در صورت فوت شما فراهم می کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001564756.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
