ave stopped ) There was a serious breach of security at the prison last Friday.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"One of the sales clerks called security.","translation":"یکی از کارمندان فروش به نام امنیت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000726166.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
