hing happens that the security should have stopped ) There was a serious breach of security at the prison last Friday.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Reiss used his Brooklyn home as security for the loan.","translation":"ریس از خانه خود در بروکلین به عنوان وثیقه برای وام استفاده کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001564765.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
