('3ac6adf7-0929-5e3f-aff8-38d44c583fc6','cfd83d7c-8575-5ff4-855d-630893cd5658',1,null,null,'spoken & written','the sets of programs that tell a computer how to do a particular job',null,null,'نرم‌افزار، برنامگی (رایانه)؛ سافـت‌ور','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['use software Several companies have already begun using the software.','run software To run the software, you will need the latest version of Windows.','load/install software Don''t let your kids load pirated games software onto your machine.','download software Users can download the software without charge.','write/design/develop software He designs software for an Atlanta-based company.','computer software He is the owner of a computer software company.','anti-virus software Make sure you have good anti-virus software installed.','business software He has been training people in the use of business software since 1983.','a software developer/engineer/designer her job as a software developer','a software package (= a set of programs ) Select a software package which suits your requirements.','a piece of software This excellent piece of software is compatible with both PCs and Macs.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"She loaded the new software .","translation":"او نرم افزار جدید را بارگذاری کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000674619.mp3"},{"sentence":"word-processing software","translation":"نرم افزار واژه پرداز","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001603738.mp3"},{"sentence":"a software company","translation":"یک شرکت نرم افزاری","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001603739.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('f529db09-cefa-5d64-b492-6287d167cf00','7d9cec31-fa3e-548f-8007-524385cc79f6',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a way of solving a problem or dealing with a difficult situation','[ countable ]',null,'راه‌حل، حل (مشکل)؛ محلول (شیمی)؛ حل (معما)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a good solution A good solution is to harvest the crop early in September.','the best/perfect/ideal solution Locking people in prison is not necessarily the ideal solution.','an effective solution The government has failed to come up with an effective solution.','a satisfactory solution (= good enough ) We will not rest until a satisfactory solution is found.','a neat solution (= simple and clever ) This sounded like a neat solution to the skills shortage.','the only solution The only solution is to greatly reduce our use of water.','the real solution (= the only good solution ) The real solution to the waste problem is to produce much less waste.','a possible solution There are three possible solutions to this problem.','an alternative solution We need to look for alternative solutions.','a simple/easy solution There is no easy solution to this problem.','a quick/speedy solution We need to find a quick solution.','a practical/workable solution (= one that is really possible ) They''ve had to find practical solutions to practical problems.','a long-term solution (= one that will be effective for a long time ) A long-term solution to the problem will not be possible until that conflict is resolved.','a quick-fix solution (= one that solves a problem for a short time only ) He has accused the government of looking for quick-fix solutions.','a peaceful/political solution (= one that does not involve fighting ) We will continue to work strenuously for a political solution acceptable to all parties.','find/come up with a solution We are working together to find the best solution we can.','seek/look for a solution The company is still seeking a solution to its financial problems.','provide/offer a solution I don''t think that tourism will provide a long-term solution to rural employment problems.','suggest/put forward a solution The chairman put forward a possible solution.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The best solution would be for them to separate.","translation":"بهترین راه حل جدا شدن آنها خواهد بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000648180.mp3"},{"sentence":"There are no simple solutions to the problem of overpopulation.","translation":"هیچ راه حل ساده ای برای مشکل ازدیاد جمعیت وجود ندارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000648183.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
