('8fa1b8b4-cb6a-58ff-a3d2-968d6fe3fd5a','d7483185-2733-5c19-8915-b115b6a8ba09',5,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'don’t be a stranger!','غریبه، ناآشنا؛ غریبه (فرد)؛ بیگانه (مجازی)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a complete/perfect/total stranger (= used to emphasize that you do not know the person ) Really, I don''t know why I''m revealing all this to a complete stranger.','a virtual stranger (= someone you hardly know ) I hadn''t seen him for so long that he seemed like a virtual stranger.','a passing stranger (= one you pass in the street ) Do not give your camera to a passing stranger and ask him to take a picture of you.','a mysterious stranger She never knew who the mysterious stranger was who had helped her that night.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('3e867413-0321-5f8e-8692-7c86ddd7f3ca','8f8d2324-ce23-552c-9018-570dae306f29',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a planned series of actions for achieving something','[ countable ]',null,'استراتژی، راهبرد؛ طرح (برتری)؛ استراتژی (فرد)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['an economic strategy The government has changed its economic strategy.','a business strategy This is a high-risk business strategy.','a marketing strategy The firm is considering a change in its marketing strategy.','a political strategy Baldwin’s political strategy was almost totally successful.','a coping strategy Therapists can show a child new coping strategies.','a survival strategy He says his father’s withdrawal was a survival strategy.','a successful/effective strategy The most successful strategy is often the simplest one.','a clear/coherent strategy It is important that the company has a clear strategy.','a high-risk strategy The expansion plan is a high-risk strategy.','a long-term strategy The closure of these branches is part of our long-term strategy.','use a strategy ( also employ a strategy formal ) What strategies do you use to deal with these problems?','adopt a strategy (= start to use it ) Both players adopted the same strategy.','devise/work out a strategy ( also formulate a strategy formal ) We had to devise strategies for saving money.','develop a strategy Groups can help members develop new coping strategies.','evolve a strategy The creatures which live in the river have evolved strategies for surviving sudden floods.','pursue/follow a strategy (= do a particular planned series of actions ) They are pursuing different strategies.','implement a strategy formal (= do a series of actions that you or someone else has planned ) The firm faces several challenges as it seeks to implement that strategy.','a strategy works The Government’s economic strategy was not working.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"the government’s long-term economic strategy","translation":"استراتژی بلندمدت اقتصادی دولت","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001600081.mp3"},{"sentence":"a company’s business strategy","translation":"استراتژی تجاری یک شرکت","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001600084.mp3"},{"sentence":"a strategy for dealing with crime","translation":"استراتژی مقابله با جرم و جنایت","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001600089.mp3"},{"sentence":"a strategy to attract younger audiences to jazz","translation":"یک استراتژی برای جذب مخاطبان جوان تر به جاز","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000619577.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('d9f399c6-e68a-57ac-b3c2-7643fe3b52e4','8f8d2324-ce23-552c-9018-570dae306f29',2,null,null,'spoken & written','the skill of planning the movements of armies in a war , or an example of this','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'مهارت برنامه ریزی حرکات ارتش ها در یک جنگ یا نمونه ای از آن','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['an economic strategy The government has changed its economic strategy.','a business strategy This is a high-risk business strategy.','a marketing strategy The firm is considering a change in its marketing strategy.','a political strategy Baldwin’s political strategy was almost totally successful.','a coping strategy Therapists can show a child new coping strategies.','a survival strategy He says his father’s withdrawal was a survival strategy.','a successful/effective strategy The most successful strategy is often the simplest one.','a clear/coherent strategy It is important that the company has a clear strategy.','a high-risk strategy The expansion plan is a high-risk strategy.','a long-term strategy The closure of these branches is part of our long-term strategy.','use a strategy ( also employ a strategy formal ) What strategies do you use to deal with these problems?','adopt a strategy (= start to use it ) Both players adopted the same strategy.','devise/work out a strategy ( also formulate a strategy formal ) We had to devise strategies for saving money.','develop a strategy Groups can help members develop new coping strategies.','evolve a strategy The creatures which live in the river have evolved strategies for surviving sudden floods.','pursue/follow a strategy (= do a particular planned series of actions ) They are pursuing different strategies.','implement a strategy formal (= do a series of actions that you or someone else has planned ) The firm faces several challenges as it seeks to implement that strategy.','a strategy works The Government’s economic strategy was not working.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"military strategies","translation":"استراتژی های نظامی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001600091.mp3"},{"sentence":"It is the general’s role to develop overall strategy .","translation":"این نقش ژنرال توسعه استراتژی کلی است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001600092.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('212dc210-dee4-5d02-91c1-2d867f0d3c4f','8f8d2324-ce23-552c-9018-570dae306f29',3,null,null,'spoken & written','skilful planning in general','[ uncountable ]',null,'برنامه ریزی ماهرانه به طور کلی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['an economic strategy The government has changed its economic strategy.','a business strategy This is a high-risk business strategy.','a marketing strategy The firm is considering a change in its marketing strategy.','a political strategy Baldwin’s political strategy was almost totally successful.','a coping strategy Therapists can show a child new coping strategies.','a survival strategy He says his father’s withdrawal was a survival strategy.','a successful/effective strategy The most successful strategy is often the simplest one.','a clear/coherent strategy It is important that the company has a clear strategy.','a high-risk strategy The expansion plan is a high-risk strategy.','a long-term strategy The closure of these branches is part of our long-term strategy.','use a strategy ( also employ a strategy formal ) What strategies do you use to deal with these problems?','adopt a strategy (= start to use it ) Both players adopted the same strategy.','devise/work out a strategy ( also formulate a strategy formal ) We had to devise strategies for saving money.','develop a strategy Groups can help members develop new coping strategies.','evolve a strategy The creatures which live in the river have evolved strategies for surviving sudden floods.','pursue/follow a strategy (= do a particular planned series of actions ) They are pursuing different strategies.','implement a strategy formal (= do a series of actions that you or someone else has planned ) The firm faces several challenges as it seeks to implement that strategy.','a strategy works The Government’s economic strategy was not working.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The company must first resolve questions of strategy.","translation":"شرکت ابتدا باید سوالات استراتژی را حل کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000619582.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('8d743566-4748-5d85-b76a-c3cc0211a4fa','8f6513ec-b3c4-5f3b-bbfd-10e45da003a0',1,'physical','فیزیکی','spoken & written','the physical power and energy that makes someone strong','[ uncountable ]',null,'قدرت، توان جسمی؛ استحکام (ماده)؛ قدرت (نظر)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['physical strength Some of the tasks required considerable physical strength.','great/enormous strength Hercules was famous for his great strength.','superhuman strength (= much greater than ordinary strength ) In the movie, Walsh performs feats of superhuman strength.','superior strength (= greater than someone else''s ) Using his superior strength, Rocky dragged the struggling Larsen another twenty yards back.','brute strength (= physical strength rather than intelligence or careful thinking ) There is more to wrestling than brute strength. Tactics are important too.','full strength It takes time to get your full strength back after you have been ill.','have the strength to do something He didn''t even have the strength to sit up.','find the strength to do something Mary found the strength to climb up onto the upturned boat.','use your strength He used all his strength to heave the door shut.','gather/muster/summon your strength (= get enough strength to do something ) He sat for a couple of minutes, gathering his strength.','build up your strength (= make yourself stronger ) You need to build up your strength.','gain strength After the operation, he spent several weeks relaxing and gaining strength.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"She didn’t even have the strength to stand up.","translation":"او حتی قدرت ایستادن را نداشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001620930.mp3"},{"sentence":"I’m trying to build up my strength .","translation":"من سعی می کنم قدرتم را تقویت کنم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001620934.mp3"},{"sentence":"Jo hit him with all her strength .","translation":"جو با تمام قدرت به او ضربه زد .","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001620940.mp3"},{"sentence":"He never ceased to be amazed by her physical strength .","translation":"او هرگز از قدرت بدنی او شگفت زده نشد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001620944.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('0ae8ed90-027a-52af-a994-2b6f5bc6c1f7','8f6513ec-b3c4-5f3b-bbfd-10e45da003a0',2,'determination','عزم','spoken & written','the quality of being brave or determined in dealing with difficult or unpleasant situations','[ uncountable ]','tower of strength','کیفیت شجاع بودن یا مصمم بودن در مواجهه با موقعیت های دشوار یا ناخوشایند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Jenny didn’t have the strength to end the relationship.","translation":"جنی قدرت پایان دادن به رابطه را نداشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001620951.mp3"},{"sentence":"She had enormous strength of character (= strong ability to deal with difficult situations ) .","translation":"او قدرت شخصیتی عظیمی داشت (= توانایی قوی برای مقابله با موقعیت های دشوار).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001620955.mp3"},{"sentence":"The sea was very cold and it required great strength of mind to get in.","translation":"دریا بسیار سرد بود و برای ورود به آن به قدرت ذهن زیادی نیاز بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001620962.mp3"},{"sentence":"I think you have to find an inner strength in order to feel good about yourself.","translation":"من فکر می کنم برای اینکه احساس خوبی نسبت به خود داشته باشید باید یک قدرت درونی پیدا کنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001620963.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('f7131d41-e77e-5a56-acd2-f2a5960981c4','8f6513ec-b3c4-5f3b-bbfd-10e45da003a0',3,'feeling/belief','احساس/باور','spoken & written','how strong a feeling, belief , or relationship is','[ uncountable ]',null,'چقدر یک احساس، باور یا رابطه قوی است',array['depth']::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Governments cannot ignore the strength of public opinion.","translation":"دولت ها نمی توانند قدرت افکار عمومی را نادیده بگیرند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000620438.mp3"},{"sentence":"We understand the strength of feeling against the proposal.","translation":"ما قدرت احساس در برابر پیشنهاد را درک می کنیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001620967.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('c5803be5-993d-5ae3-a188-a27e0d29e505','8f6513ec-b3c4-5f3b-bbfd-10e45da003a0',4,'organization/country etc','سازمان/کشور و غیره','spoken & written','the political, military , or economic power of an organization , country, or system','[ uncountable ]',null,'قدرت سیاسی، نظامی یا اقتصادی یک سازمان، کشور یا سیستم','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"the strength of the US economy","translation":"قدرت اقتصاد آمریکا","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000620454.mp3"},{"sentence":"The socialists organized a show of strength (= when a country or organization shows how strong it is ) .","translation":"سوسیالیست ها نمایش قدرت را ترتیب دادند (= زمانی که یک کشور یا سازمان نشان می دهد که چقدر قوی است).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001620971.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('ab6a617a-cd07-59e2-8396-34a2de0aeca3','8f6513ec-b3c4-5f3b-bbfd-10e45da003a0',5,'useful quality or ability','کیفیت یا توانایی مفید','spoken & written','a particular quality or ability that gives someone or something an advantage','[ countable ]',null,'کیفیت یا توانایی خاصی که به کسی یا چیزی مزیت می دهد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Her main strength is her critical thinking ability.","translation":"نقطه قوت اصلی او توانایی تفکر انتقادی اوست.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001620977.mp3"},{"sentence":"The great strength of our plan lies in its simplicity.","translation":"قدرت بزرگ طرح ما در سادگی آن نهفته است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001620980.mp3"},{"sentence":"Be aware of your own strengths and weaknesses .","translation":"از نقاط قوت و ضعف خود آگاه باشید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001620982.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('2e046933-f718-50cf-b204-31263642c111','8f6513ec-b3c4-5f3b-bbfd-10e45da003a0',6,'object','شی','spoken & written','how strong an object or structure is, especially its ability to last for a long time without breaking','[ uncountable ]',null,'یک جسم یا سازه چقدر قوی است، به ویژه توانایی آن برای ماندگاری طولانی بدون شکستن','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"a device for testing the strength of concrete structures","translation":"دستگاهی برای آزمایش مقاومت سازه های بتنی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000620406.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('cf7f7b7e-92bf-58eb-b9d0-c9c5104314c3','8f6513ec-b3c4-5f3b-bbfd-10e45da003a0',7,'substance/mixture','ماده/مخلوط','spoken & written','how strong a substance or mixture is','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'یک ماده یا مخلوط چقدر قوی است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Add water to dilute the solution to the required strength.","translation":"آب را اضافه کنید تا محلول به قدرت لازم رقیق شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000620463.mp3"},{"sentence":"Young plants can be fed with half-strength liquid fertilizer.","translation":"گیاهان جوان را می توان با کود مایع نیمه قوت تغذیه کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000620466.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('a9eeef3c-370e-5861-8c5f-2321178d6ce0','8f6513ec-b3c4-5f3b-bbfd-10e45da003a0',8,'number of people','تعداد افراد','spoken & written','the number of people in a team , army etc','[ uncountable ]',null,'تعداد افراد در یک تیم، ارتش و غیره','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The Edinburgh team are now at full strength .","translation":"تیم ادینبورگ اکنون در قدرت کامل است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001620987.mp3"},{"sentence":"The police force is below strength at the moment (= there are fewer police than there should be ) .","translation":"نیروی پلیس در حال حاضر پایین تر از قدرت است (= تعداد پلیس کمتر از آنچه باید باشد).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001620993.mp3"},{"sentence":"Security forces were out in strength (= in large numbers ) but did not intervene.","translation":"نیروهای امنیتی با قدرت (= در تعداد زیاد) حضور داشتند اما مداخله نکردند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001620998.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
